#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Not all problems can be solved with better hardware, but choosing the right "
"hardware is an absolute necessity for large scale deployments."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກບັນຫາຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ດ້ວຍຮາດແວທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ການເລືອກຮາດແວທີ່ເໝາະສົມແມ່ນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:3
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Server are:"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Server ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:4
msgid "Eight or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU ແບບ {x86_64} ຈຳນວນ 8 ຄໍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:5
msgid "32{nbsp}GiB RAM."
msgstr "RAM ຂະໜາດ 32{nbsp}GiB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:6
msgid "For installations with thousands of clients, use 64{nbsp}GB or more."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 64{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:7
msgid "Fast I/O storage devices, such as locally attached SSDs."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມໄວສູງ (Fast I/O), ເຊັ່ນ SSD ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:8
msgid "For PostgreSQL data directories, we recommend locally attached RAID-0 SSDs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAID-0 SSD ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If the {productname} Server is virtualized, enable the `elevator=none` "
"kernel command line option, for the best input/output performance.  You can "
"check the current status with [command]``cat "
"/sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``.  This command will display a list of "
"available schedulers with the currently active one in brackets.  To change "
"the scheduler before a reboot, use [command]``echo none > "
"/sys/block/<DEVICE>/queue/scheduler``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:10
msgid "The minimum requirements for the {productname} Proxy are:"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"One {productname} Proxy per 500-1000 clients, depending on available network "
"bandwidth."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:12
msgid "Two or more recent {x86_64} CPU cores."
msgstr "CPU ແບບ {x86_64} ຈຳນວນ 2 ຄໍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:13
msgid "16{nbsp}GB RAM, and sufficient storage for caching."
msgstr "RAM ຂະໜາດ 16{nbsp}GB, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບການເຮັດ cache."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Clients should never be directly attached to the {productname} Server in "
"production systems."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (Production), ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຄວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In large scale installations, the {productname} Proxy is used primarily as a "
"local cache for content between the server and clients.  Using proxies in "
"this way can substantially reduce download time for clients, and decrease "
"Server egress bandwidth use."
msgstr "ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, {productname} Proxy ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນ local cache ຫຼັກສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ. ການໃຊ້ proxy ໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດເວລາໃນການດາວໂຫລດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ແບນວິດຂາອອກຂອງເຊີເວີໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The number of clients per proxy will affect the download time.  Always take "
"network structure and available bandwidth into account."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍຕໍ່ proxy ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເວລາດາວໂຫລດ. ຄວນພິຈາລະນາໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ແບນວິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"We recommend you estimate the download time of typical usage to determine "
"how many clients to connnect to each proxy.  To do this, you will need to "
"estimate the number of package upgrades required in every patch cycle.  You "
"can use this formula to calculate the download time:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປະເມີນເວລາດາວໂຫລດຂອງການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຄວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍຈັກເຄື່ອງກັບແຕ່ລະ proxy. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປະເມີນຈຳນວນການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນແຕ່ລະຮອບການ patch. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສູດນີ້ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ເວລາດາວໂຫລດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size of updates * Number of clients / Theoretical download speed / 60\n"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງການອັບເດດ * ຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍ / ຄວາມໄວໃນການດາວໂຫລດທາງທິດສະດີ / 60\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For example, the total time needed to transfer 400{nbsp}MB of upgrades "
"through a physical link speed of 1{nbsp}GB/s to 3000 clients:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການອັບເກຣດ 400{nbsp}MB ຜ່ານຄວາມໄວລິ້ງ 1{nbsp}GB/s ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ 3000 ເຄື່ອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hardware-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "400 MB  * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 min\n"
msgstr "400 MB * 3000 / 119 MB/s / 60 = 169 ນາທີ\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Hub XMLRPC API"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When XMLRPC API is running, connect to the service at port 2830 using any "
"XMLRPC-compliant client libraries.  For examples, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-api.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Logs are saved in ``/var/log/hub/hub-xmlrpc-api.log``.  Logs are rotated "
"weekly, or when the log file size reaches the specified limit.  By default, "
"the log file size limit is 10{nbsp}MB."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Authentication Modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ Hub XMLRPC API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:2
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different authentication modes:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສາມແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Manual mode (default): API credentials must be explicitly provided for each "
"server."
msgstr "ໂໝດປ້ອນເອງ (Manual mode - ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບ API ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Relay mode: the credentials used to authenticate with the Hub are also used "
"to authenticate to each server."
msgstr "ໂໝດສົ່ງຕໍ່ (Relay mode): ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ Hub ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:5
msgid "You must provide a list of servers to connect to."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລະບຸລາຍຊື່ເຊີເວີທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode: credentials are reused for each server, and any "
"peripheral server you have access to is automatically connected."
msgstr "ໂໝດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Auto-connect mode): ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຊ້ຳສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໃດໆທີ່ເຈົ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:8
msgid "This section provides examples of each authentication method."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manual Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບປ້ອນເອງ (Manual)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In manual mode, credentials have to be explicitly provided for each "
"peripheral server before you can connect to it."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດປ້ອນເອງ, ຕ້ອງລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຢ່າງຊັດເຈນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:11
msgid "A typical workflow for manual authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບປ້ອນເອງແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``login`` method, and a session "
"key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"``hub.listServerIds`` method."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Credentials for each peripheral server are provided to the "
"``attachToServers`` method."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:41
msgid "This performs authentication against each server's XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ XMLRPC API endpoint ຂອງແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:42
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:62
msgid "A ``multicast`` call is performed on a set of servers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This is defined by ``serverIds``, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, ``system.list_system`` is called on each "
"server's XMLRPC API"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:44
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Hub aggregates the results and returns the response in the form of a "
"``map``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:45
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:65
msgid "The map has two entries:"
msgstr "Map ຈະມີສອງລາຍການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:46
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:66
msgid ""
"``Successful``: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the "
"call succeeded."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:21
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:67
msgid ""
"``Failed``: list of responses for those peripheral servers where the call "
"failed."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you want to call a method on just one {productname} Server, then Hub API "
"also provides a ``unicast`` namespace.  In this case, the response will be a "
"single value and not a map, in the same way as if you called that "
"{productname} server's API directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Manual Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບປ້ອນເອງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:24
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:49
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:50
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL = \"<HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL>\"\n"
"HUB_USERNAME = \"<USERNAME>\"\n"
"HUB_PASSWORD = \"<PASSWORD>\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:51
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"
msgstr "client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy(HUB_XMLRPC_API_URL, verbose=0)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.login(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:28
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:53
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Get the server IDs\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຂໍເອົາ server ID\n"
"serverIds = client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# For simplicity, this example assumes you are using the same username and "
"password here, as on the hub server.\n"
"# However, in most cases, every server has its own individual credentials.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເພື່ອຄວາມງ່າຍ, ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ hub server.\n"
"# ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບຂອງຕົນເອງ.\n"
"usernames = [HUB_USERNAME for s in serverIds]\n"
"passwords = [HUB_PASSWORD for s in serverIds]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Each server uses the credentials set above, client.hub.attachToServers "
"needs\n"
"# them passed as lists with as many elements as there are servers.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ, client.hub.attachToServers ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"# ຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນສົ່ງເປັນ list ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນເຊີເວີ.\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds, usernames, passwords)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມປະຕິບັດການ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:32
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:56
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"
msgstr ""
"for system in successfulResponses:\n"
"  print(system)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:33
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:57
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Log out\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ອອກຈາກລະບົບ\n"
"client.hub.logout(hubSessionKey)\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Relay Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບສົ່ງຕໍ່ (Relay)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In relay authentication mode, the credentials used to sign in to the Hub API "
"are also used to sign in into the APIs of the peripheral servers the user "
"wants to work with.  In this authentication mode, it is assumed that the "
"same credentials are valid for every server, and that they correspond to a "
"user with appropriate permissions."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບສົ່ງຕໍ່, ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ Hub API ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ API ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳນຳອີກ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ຈະສົມມຸດວ່າຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບດຽວກັນນັ້ນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກເຊີເວີ ແລະ ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດອະນຸຍາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:36
msgid ""
"After signing in, you must call the ``attachToServers`` method.  This method "
"defines the servers to target in all subsequent calls."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:37
msgid "A typical workflow for relay authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບສົ່ງຕໍ່ແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``loginWithAuthRelayMode`` method, "
"and a session key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Using the session key from the previous step, {productname} Server IDs are "
"obtained for all the peripheral servers attached to the Hub via the "
"``hub.listServerIds`` method"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:40
msgid ""
"A call to `attachToServers` is made, and the same credentials used to sign "
"in to the Hub are passed to each server."
msgstr "ເຮັດການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `attachToServers`, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ Hub ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາແຕ່ລະເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:43
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:63
msgid ""
"This is defined by ``serverIds``, which contains the IDs of the servers to "
"target.  In the background, ``system.list_system`` is called on each "
"server's XMLRPC API."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:47
msgid "``Failed``: list of responses for those peripheral servers the call failed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Relay Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບສົ່ງຕໍ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr "hubSessionKey = client.hub.loginWithAuthRelayMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Authenticate those servers(same credentials will be used as of hub to "
"authenticate)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການເຂົ້າລະບົບດຽວກັນກັບ hub ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ)\n"
"client.hub.attachToServers(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:55
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Perform the needed operation\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, "
"serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"# ເລີ່ມປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"systemsPerServer = client.multicast.system.list_systems(hubSessionKey, serverIds)\n"
"successfulResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Successful\"][\"Responses\"]\n"
"failedResponses = systemsPerServer[\"Failed\"][\"Responses\"]\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Auto-Connect Authentication"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Auto-connect mode is similar to relay mode, it uses the Hub credentials to "
"sign in in to all peripheral servers.  However, there is no need to use the "
"``attachToServers`` method, as auto-connect mode connects to all available "
"peripheral servers.  This occurs at the same time as you sign in to the Hub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:60
msgid "A typical workflow for auto-connect authentication is:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກປົກກະຕິສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Credentials for the Hub are passed to the ``loginWithAutoconnectMode`` "
"method, and a session key for the Hub is returned (``hubSessionKey``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Python Script for Auto-Connect Authentication:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ Python Script ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, "
"HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"loginResponse = client.hub.loginWithAutoconnectMode(HUB_USERNAME, HUB_PASSWORD)\n"
"hubSessionKey = loginResponse[\"SessionKey\"]\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Deployment with XMLRPC"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can deploy a hub environment either with third party certificates or "
"with self-generated certificates."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ hub ໄດ້ທັງດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ (third party) ຫຼື ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງ (self-generated)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about SSL certificates, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc#lsd-hub-reqs-certs[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "With Third Party Certificates"
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME: what does this actually mean?
#.         Just checking that you have those available and use them
#.         while deploying the hub infrastructure?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Prepare third party certificates for both the Hub Server and the Peripheral "
"servers first."
msgstr "ກຽມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກສຳລັບທັງ Hub Server ແລະ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍກ່ອນ."

#.  For a hub environment, first ... then ...
#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Server Installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the Hub Server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Install a container host with {sle-micro}.  For more information about "
"{sle-micro} as a container host, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma#deploy-suma-server-micro[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:9
msgid ""
"On the container host, deploy {productname} as the hub server using the "
"third party certificate.  Add [option]``--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1`` to the "
"[command]``mgradm install`` command line.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert "
"hub.crt --ssl-server-key hub.key --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about deploying with [command]``mgradm``, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc#deploy-suma-server-mgradm[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:27
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peripheral Servers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing peripheral servers using third party certificates"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາຍນອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: A certificate for every peripheral server (for "
"example, [literal]``server.crt``) and a key (for example, "
"[literal]``server.key``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:15
msgid "Preliminary Requirement: CA Certificate."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: Hub server installation.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-3rd-hub[]."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-3rd-hub[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, copy the same CA to "
"[path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`` and run ``update-ca-certificates``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:18
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, install {productname} using the following "
"command (replace appropriately the names of the certificates):"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ປ່ຽນຊື່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root CA-Certificate.crt --ssl-server-cert "
"server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key\n"
msgstr ""

#.  ========================================================================
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "With Self-Generated Certificates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the hub server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:24
msgid ""
"On the container host, deploy {productname} as the hub server.  Add "
"[option]``--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1`` to the [command]``mgradm install`` "
"command line.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman suma.example.com --hubxmlrpc-replicas 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Peripheral Servers with Self-Generated Certificates"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Preliminary Requirement: Hub server installation.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-self-hub[]."
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Hub server. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc#lsd-hub-install-self-hub[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:30
msgid "On the container host of the hub server, enter the server container with:"
msgstr "ໃນ container host ຂອງ hub server, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:31
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Inside the container, run [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` for every pheripheral "
"server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=PERIPHAL --set-cname=\"example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:34
msgid "For every peripheral server:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:35
msgid ""
"From the hub server container, copy "
"[path]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT``, "
"[path]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.crt`` and "
"[path]``/root/ssl-build/<hostname>/server.key`` to the peripheral server "
"host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:36
msgid ""
"On every peripheral server host, copy [path]``RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` to "
"[path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``, and run "
"[command]``update-ca-certificates``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:37
msgid "On every peripheral server host, deploy {productname} with:"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກ host ຂອງເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT "
"--ssl-server-cert server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Finally, on every peripheral server host, register the peripheral server to "
"the hub server:"
msgstr ""

#.  CHECKIT: did we specify the credential during the hub server deployment?
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm hub register --api-password <hub password> --api-server <hub fqdn> "
"--api-user <hub admin>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background Information"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:42
msgid "Checking the following hub configuration settings is optional."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ hub ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:43
msgid ""
"On the container host, find environment variables in "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service`` generated by "
"[command]``mgradm``.  If needed, you can customize these variables with "
"[literal]``Environment=``settings in a user created "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/uyuni-hub-xmlrpc.service.d/local.conf`` "
"[systemitem]``systemd`` configuration file on the container host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:44
msgid ""
"It will override settings in [path]``/etc/hub/hub.conf`` inside the server "
"container.  It is the same file for all containers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:45
msgid "``HUB_API_URL``: URL to the Hub Server XMLRPC API endpoint."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Use the default value if you are installing `hub-xmlrpc-api` on the Hub "
"Server.  It is set automatically in the systemd unit file during the "
"installation."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງ `hub-xmlrpc-api` ເທິງ Hub Server. ມັນຖືກຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ systemd unit file ລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:47
msgid ""
"``HUB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT``: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a "
"response when connecting to a Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:48
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:50
msgid "Use the default value in most cases."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:49
msgid ""
"``HUB_REQUEST_TIMEOUT``: the maximum number of seconds to wait for a "
"response when calling a Server method."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:51
msgid ""
"``HUB_CONNECT_USING_SSL``: use HTTPS instead of HTTP for communicating with "
"peripheral Servers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-install.adoc:52
msgid "Recommended for a secure environment.  It is always enabled."
msgstr "ແນະນຳສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ. ມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານສະເໝີ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple Servers with Hub to Manage Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍເຊີເວີຮ່ວມກັບ Hub ເພື່ອຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you need to manage a large number of clients, in most cases you can do so "
"with a single {productname} Server, tuned appropriately.  However, if you "
"need to manage tens of thousands of clients, you might find it easier to use "
"multiple {productname} Servers, in a hub, to manage them."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Hub helps you manage very large deployments.  The typical Hub "
"topology looks like this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"
msgstr "typical-hub-architecture-overview.svg"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To copy contents between servers, you can use Inter-Server Synchronization "
"(ISS).  ISS allows you to export data from one server (source) and import it "
"on another (target) server.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:iss_intro.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub XMLRPC API Namespaces"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API Namespaces"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API operates in a similar way to the {productname} API.  For "
"{productname} API documentation, see https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Hub XMLRPC API exposes the same methods that are available from the "
"server's XMLRPC API, with a few differences in parameter and return types.  "
"Additionally, the Hub XMLRPC API supports some Hub-specific end points which "
"are not available in the {productname} API."
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ເປີດເຜີຍເມທອດດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ XMLRPC API ຂອງເຊີເວີ, ໂດຍມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງບາງຢ່າງໃນປະເພດພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ປະເພດຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, Hub XMLRPC API ຍັງຮອງຮັບບາງ endpoint ທີ່ເປັນຂອງ Hub ໂດຍສະເພາະ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} API."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:4
msgid "The Hub XMLRPC API supports three different namespaces:"
msgstr "Hub XMLRPC API ຮອງຮັບສາມ namespace ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:5
msgid "The ``hub`` namespace is used to target the Hub XMLRPC API Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:6
msgid ""
"It supports Hub-specific XMLRPC endpoints which are primarily related to "
"authentication."
msgstr "ມັນຮອງຮັບ Hub-specific XMLRPC endpoints ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The ``unicast`` namespace is used to target a single server registered in "
"the hub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:8
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to one specific server and returns any "
"value as if the server's XMLRPC API endpoint was used directly."
msgstr "ມັນຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃດໆໄປຫາເຊີເວີສະເພາະເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງຢ່າງໂປ່ງໃສ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າໃດໆຄືກັບວ່າ XMLRPC API endpoint ຂອງເຊີເວີນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The ``multicast`` namespace is used to target multiple peripheral servers "
"registered in the hub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:10
msgid ""
"It redirects any call transparently to all the specified servers and returns "
"the results in the form of a ``map``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:11
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a namespace, all calls are transparently redirected to "
"the underlying {productname} Server XMLRPC API of the Hub Server."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ namespace, ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ {productname} Server XMLRPC API ພື້ນຖານຂອງ Hub Server ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This allows you to call all available methods on the {productname} Server "
"XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ທຸກເມທອດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Methods called without specifying any of the above namespaces will be "
"forwarded to the normal XMLRPC API of the hub.  This is the API exposed on "
"ports 80 and 443."
msgstr "ເມທອດທີ່ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ລະບຸ namespace ໃດໆຂ້າງເທິງ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ XMLRPC API ປົກກະຕິຂອງ hub. ນີ້ແມ່ນ API ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນພອດ 80 ແລະ 443."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:14
msgid "Some important considerations for hub namespaces:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ hub namespaces:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Individual server IDs can be obtained using "
"``client.hub.listServerIds(hubSessionKey)``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The ``unicast`` namespace assumes all methods receive ``hubSessionKey`` and "
"serverID as their first two parameters, then any other parameter as "
"specified by the regular Server API."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, "
"param2)\n"
msgstr "client.unicast.[namespace].[methodName](hubSessionKey, serverId, param1, param2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The ``hubSessionKey`` can be obtained using different authentication "
"methods."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-auth.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The ``multicast`` namespace assumes all methods receive ``hubSessionKey``, a "
"list of ``ServerID`` values, then lists of per-server parameters as "
"specified by the regular server XMLRPC API."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The return value is a ``map``, with ``Successful`` and ``Failed`` entries "
"for each server involved in the call."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-namespaces.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, "
"serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"
msgstr "client.multicast.[namespace].[methodname](hubSessionKey, [serverId1, serverId2], [param1_s1, param1_s2], [param2_s1, param2_s2])\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Reporting"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານຂອງ Hub"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Hub prepares and provides content for multiple peripheral {productname} "
"Servers.  The goal of the reporting feature is to get data from these "
"Servers back and have combined reporting data available on the Hub.  The "
"data is made available for external Reporting Tools."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The main database is a PostgreSQL database in the {productname} Hub system.  "
"It stores all the information collected from all the servers, and aggregates "
"them.  Every peripheral Server has its own reporting database where the "
"information is collected for that system.  In summary:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:5
msgid ""
"the DB in {productname} Hub stores, collects and aggregates data coming from "
"all the DBs of the peripheral Servers,"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"the DB in {productname} Hub stores also its own data from the systems "
"directly connected and managed by the Hub,"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:7
msgid "the DB in peripheral {productname} Server stores its own data,"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"the reporting tool can be connected either to the Hub or to any "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The reporting database and schema are set up by default using the local "
"PostgreSQL server.  The reporting database is a separate database accessible "
"via the network."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As a requirement we expect all server certificates are signed by the same "
"Root Certificate Authority (CA).  The whole {productname} Hub environment "
"should be using only one Root CA."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For more information about certificates, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc#lsd-hub-reqs-certs[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a DB user for the reporting"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Before connecting an external Reporting Tools to the Database, a user with "
"read-only permission should be created.  For doing that, it is possible to "
"use ``uyuni-setup-reportdb-user``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: uyuni-setup-reportdb-user [options]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"options:\n"
"  --help\n"
"            show this help message and exit\n"
"  --non-interactive\n"
"            Switches to non-interactive mode\n"
"  --dbuser=DBUSER\n"
"            Report DB User\n"
"  --dbpassword=DBPASSWORD\n"
"            Report DB Password\n"
"  --add\n"
"            Add the new user\n"
"  --delete\n"
"            Delete the user\n"
"  --modify\n"
"            Set a new password\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Schema"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The schema exports the most important tables from the main {productname} "
"Database as a de-normalized variant containing only data which are relevant "
"for a report."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Ready-to-use reports are provided as views, aggregating data over multiple "
"tables."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Every table gets an extra id column (`mgm_id`) specifying the {productname} "
"server which provided the data.  On a single {productname} Server this "
"column has the standard value `1` which represent [literal]``localhost``.  "
"On the {productname} Hub it is replaced with the real server id the managed "
"server has in the hub database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Another common additional field is `synced_date`, which represents the time "
"when the data were exported from the main {productname} Server database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Help[Report Database Schema] to find the schema "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Generation and Update"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:24
msgid ""
"{productname} uses taskomatic jobs to generate the data for the reporting "
"database and to get the data from the peripheral servers to the hub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:25
msgid ""
"To generate and update the data on a peripheral server, the responsible "
"schedule is called `update-reporting-default`.  It is executed by default "
"daily at midnight."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:26
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Hub there is a second schedule which is important.  To "
"fetch the reporting data from all registered peripheral servers, the task "
"with the name `update-reporting-hub-default` is executed daily at 1:30 AM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:27
msgid ""
"All times are in the local timezone of the server.  If the peripheral "
"servers are in different timezones, it is recommended to align all the "
"schedules.  Make sure that all reporting data are gathered at a specific "
"point in time, and `update-reporting-hub-default` is running when all "
"peripheral servers have actually finished their local jobs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Reporting Jobs"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_batch_size`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of rows fetched and written from "
"one database to the other in one shot.\n"
"| Tune when            | Out of memory errors or on processing speed "
"problems.\n"
"| Value default        | 2000\n"
"| Value recommendation | 500 - 5000\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_batch_size = 4000`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory usage closely before and after the "
"change.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "`report_db_hub_workers`"
msgstr "`report_db_hub_workers`"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reporting.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Description          | The maximum number of workers requesting data from "
"peripheral servers on a hub at the same point in time.\n"
"| Tune when            | The number of peripheral servers increases "
"significantly (more than 100), or a faster synchronization is required.\n"
"| Value default        | 2\n"
"| Value recommendation | 2 - 10\n"
"| Location             | [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``\n"
"| Example              | `report_db_hub_workers = 5`\n"
"| After changing       | Check xref:memory-usage[memory usage].\n"
"                         Monitor memory and cpu usage of the hub closely "
"before and after the change.\n"
"                         Also monitor the load, cpu and memory usage of the "
"reporting database of the hub.\n"
"| Notes                | All the data collected from the peripheral server "
"must be written into the hub reporting database.\n"
"                         Tuning that database could increase the performance "
"as well.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Requirements"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:2
msgid "To set up a Hub installation, you require:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:3
msgid "One central {productname} Server, which acts as the Hub Server."
msgstr "{productname} Server ສູນກາງໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ Hub Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"One or more additional {productname} Servers, registered to the Hub.  This "
"document refers to these additional servers as peripheral servers."
msgstr "{productname} Servers ເພີ່ມເຕີມໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Hub. ເອກະສານນີ້ເອີ້ນເຊີເວີເພີ່ມເຕີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ວ່າ ເຊີເວີສ່ວນປາຍ (peripheral servers)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:5
msgid "Any number of clients registered to the peripheral servers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Ensure the Hub Server and all peripheral servers are running "
"{productname}{nbsp}5.0 or higher."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Deploy the central {productname} Server, which acts as the Hub Server, with "
"the [command]``mgradm`` command.  Add [option]``--hubxmlrpc-replicas 1`` to "
"the [command]``mgradm install`` command line.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information about hub server deployment, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-install.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The Hub Server must not have clients registered to it.  Clients should only "
"be registered to the Peripheral Servers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The Hub Server's and the Peripheral Servers' SSL certificates must be signed "
"by the same CA.  There are two ways to fulfill this requirement:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:14
msgid "Use third party certificates."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Deploy the Hub Server first and use it to generate the certificates for the "
"Peripheral Servers.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc#lsd-hub-reqs-gencerts[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the Certificates for Peripheral Servers"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you will use third party provided Certificates, you can skip this "
"procedure."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating the Certificates for Peripheral Servers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:19
msgid "From the container host, enter the shell in the Hub Server container with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On the command line, run [command]``rhn-ssl-tool`` for each Peripheral "
"Server (replace placeholders such as [literal]``COUNTRY``, "
"[literal]``STATE``, [literal]``example.com``, etc. with values from your "
"environment):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"HOSTNAME\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:23
msgid "Copy these files to the Peripheral Server host:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:24
msgid "[path]``/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:25
msgid "[path]``/root/ssl-build/HOSTNAME/server.crt``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:26
msgid "[path]``/root/ssl-build/HOSTNAME/server.key``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Deploy the peripheral servers with [command]``mgradm``.  For more "
"information about deploying with [command]``mgradm``, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:Deploying and Registering Peripheral Servers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:30
msgid "Prepare Peripheral Server hosts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:31
msgid "On each Peripheral Server host:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Copy [path]``RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`` to [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/`` "
"and run [command]``update-ca-certificates``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:33
msgid "Deploy the Peripheral Server with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm install podman --ssl-ca-root RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert server.crt --ssl-server-key server.key\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:35
msgid "On each Peripheral Server host register Peripheral Server to the Hub Server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm hub register --api-server <HUB_FQDN> --api-user <HUB_ADMIN> \\\n"
"  --api-password <HUB_ADMIN_PASSWORD>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Peripheral Servers must be registered to the Hub Server as foreign clients.  "
"Standard registration methods cannot be used."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Peripheral Servers must be registered to the Hub Server directly, do not use "
"a proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Optionally, it is possible to register the podman container host as a "
"standard client ({salt} minion) and manage it from {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#.  You need credentials to access the XMLRPC APIs on each server, including the Hub Server.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/hub-reqs.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Now the XMLRPC API is available and reportdb synchronization will take "
"place."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring Large Scale Deployments"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on clients."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana. {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ສາມາດສະໜອງ metrics ກ່ຽວກັບສຸຂະພາບຂອງລະບົບເອງໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈັດການ Prometheus exporters ຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {rhel}{nbsp}7, {rhel}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 and "
"openSUSE 15.x."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Client Tools ສຳລັບ {sle}{nbsp}12, {sle}{nbsp}15, {centos}{nbsp}7, {centos}{nbsp}8 ແລະ openSUSE 15.x."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend you use a managed client as your "
"monitoring server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus ແລະ Grafana ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ {productname} Server. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (managed client) ເປັນເຊີເວີຕິດຕາມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/monitoring.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕາມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operation Recommendations"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳດ້ານການປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains a range of recommendations for large scale "
"deployments."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ບັນຈຸຄຳແນະນຳຕ່າງໆສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Always start small and scale up gradually.  Monitor the server as you scale "
"to identify problems early."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຈຳນວນນ້ອຍໆສະເໝີ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍໆຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຕິດຕາມເຊີເວີໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍເພື່ອລະບຸບັນຫາໄດ້ໄວ."

#.  Might be worth alphabetising these. LKB 2018-08-09
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Onboarding Rate"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The rate at which {productname} can onboard clients is limited and depends "
"on hardware resources.  Onboarding clients at a faster rate than "
"{productname} is configured for will build up a backlog of unprocessed "
"keys.  This slows down the process and can potentially exhaust resources.  "
"We recommend that you limit the acceptance key rate programmatically.  A "
"safe starting point would be to onboard a client every 15 seconds.  You can "
"do that with this command:"
msgstr "ອັດຕາທີ່ {productname} ສາມາດນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboard) ແມ່ນມີຂີດຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວ. ການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄວກວ່າທີ່ {productname} ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດມີຄີ (keys) ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນຄ້າງຢູ່ຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນຊ້າລົງ ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນໝົດໄປ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈຳກັດອັດຕາການຮັບຄີດ້ວຍການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມ. ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ປອດໄພຄືການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບທຸກໆ 15 ວິນາທີ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep "
"15; done\n"
msgstr "for k in $(salt-key -l un|grep -v Unaccepted); do salt-key -y -a $k; sleep 15; done\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clients and the RNG"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ RNG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"All communication to and from clients is encrypted.  During client "
"onboarding, {salt} uses asymmetric cryptography, which requires available "
"entropy from the Random Number Generator (RNG) facility in the kernel.  If "
"sufficient entropy is not available from the RNG, it will significantly slow "
"down communications.  This is especially true in virtualized environments.  "
"Ensure enough entropy is present, or change the virtualization host options."
msgstr "ການສື່ສານທັງໝົດໄປຫາ ແລະ ມາຈາກລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, {salt} ຈະໃຊ້ asymmetric cryptography ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການ entropy ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກ Random Number Generator (RNG) ໃນ kernel. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ entropy ພຽງພໍຈາກ RNG, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການສື່ສານຊ້າລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ virtualized. ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຄ່າ entropy ມີພຽງພໍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຕົວເລືອກຂອງ virtualization host."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"You can check the amount of available entropy with the [command]``cat "
"/proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail``.  It should never be below 100-200."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clients Running with Unaccepted {salt} Keys"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ {salt} Keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Idle clients which have not been onboarded, that is clients running with "
"unaccepted {salt} keys, consume more resources than idle clients that have "
"been onboarded.  Generally, this consumes about an extra 2.5 Kb/s of inbound "
"network bandwidth per client.  For example, 1000 idle clients will consume "
"about 2.5 Mb/s extra.  This consumption will reduce almost to zero when "
"onboarding has been completed for all clients.  Limit the number of "
"non-onboarded clients for optimal performance."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ລ້າໆ (idle) ເຊິ່ງຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ, ນັ້ນຄືລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍ {salt} keys ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ, ຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາເຂົ້າເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນປະມານ 2.5 Kb/s ຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລູກຂ່າຍ 1000 ເຄື່ອງ ຈະໃຊ້ແບນວິດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນປະມານ 2.5 Mb/s. ການໃຊ້ນີ້ຈະຫຼຸດລົງເກືອບເປັນສູນເມື່ອການນຳລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບສຳເລັດ. ໃຫ້ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ onboard ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling the {salt} Mine"
msgstr "ການປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In older versions, {productname} used a tool called {salt} Mine to check "
"client availability.  The {salt} Mine would cause clients to contact the "
"server every hour, which created significant load.  Since the introduction "
"of a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the {salt} Mine is "
"no longer required.  Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to "
"ping only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or "
"more, with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four "
"hour period by default.  You can adjust this by changing the "
"[systemitem]``web.system_checkin_threshold`` parameter in "
"[path]``rhn.conf``.  The value is expressed in days, and the default value "
"is [literal]``1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Newly registered clients will have the {salt} Mine disabled by default.  If "
"the {salt} Mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling "
"it.  This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າ {salt} Mine ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເເຈົ້າສາມາດຫຼຸດ load ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນຜົນດີຫຼາຍຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:15
msgid "Disable the {salt} Mine by running this command on the server:"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ {salt} Mine ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນເຊີເວີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:16
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"This will restart the clients and generate some {salt} events to be "
"processed by the server.  If you have a large number of clients, handling "
"these events could create excessive load.  To avoid this, you can execute "
"the command in batch mode with this command:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ restart ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສ້າງເຫດການ {salt} ບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຊີເວີປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການຈັດການເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະສ້າງ load ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລັນຄຳສັ່ງໃນຮູບແບບ batch mode ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:18
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls util.mgr_mine_config_clean_up\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:19
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You will need to wait for this command to finish executing.  Do not end the "
"process with kbd:[Ctrl+C]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ. ຢ່າຍົກເລີກຂະບວນການດ້ວຍ kbd:[Ctrl+C]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Unnecessary Taskomatic Jobs"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກ Taskomatic ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To minimize wasted resources, you can disable non-essential or unused "
"Taskomatic jobs."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການສູນເສຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກ Taskomatic ທີ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can see the list of Taskomatic jobs in the {productname} {webui}, at "
"menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ວຽກ Taskomatic ໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ທີ່ menu:Admin[Task Schedules]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"To disable a job, click the name of the job you want to disable, select "
"[guimenu]``Disable Schedule``, and click btn:[Update Schedule]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To delete a job, click the name of the job you want to delete, and click "
"btn:[Delete Schedule]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບວຽກ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Schedule]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:25
msgid "We recommend disabling these jobs:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Daily comparison of configuration files: "
"[systemitem]``compare-configs-default``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Hourly synchronization of {cobbler} files: "
"[systemitem]``cobbler-sync-default``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Daily gatherer and subscription matcher: "
"[systemitem]``gatherer-matcher-default``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to disable any other jobs, as it could prevent {productname} "
"from functioning correctly."
msgstr "ຢ່າພະຍາຍາມປິດໃຊ້ງານວຽກອື່ນໆ, ເພາະມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {productname} ບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap and Monitoring"
msgstr "Swap ແລະ ການຕິດຕາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"It is especially important in large scale deployments that you keep your "
"{productname} Server constantly monitored and backed up."
msgstr "ມັນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນເປັນພິເສດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Swap space use can have significant impacts on performance.  If significant "
"non-transient swap usage is detected, you can increase the available "
"hardware RAM."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Swap space ອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຖ້າກວດພົບການໃຊ້ swap ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ເຈົ້າຄວນເພີ່ມ RAM ຂອງຮາດແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"You can also consider tuning the Server to consume less memory.  For more "
"information on tuning, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງເຊີເວີເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAM ໜ້ອຍລົງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປັບແຕ່ງ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "AES Key Rotation"
msgstr "ການໝູນວຽນ AES Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Communications from the {salt} Master to clients is encrypted with a single "
"AES key.  The key is rotated when:"
msgstr "ການສື່ສານຈາກ {salt} Master ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ AES key ດຽວ. ຄີຈະຖືກໝູນວຽນເມື່ອ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:36
msgid "The ``salt-master`` process is restarted, or"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Any minion key is deleted (for example, when a client is deleted from "
"{productname})"
msgstr "ມີ minion key ໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກລຶບ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ {productname})"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:38
msgid ""
"After the AES key has been rotated, all clients must re-authenticate to the "
"master.  By default, this happens next time a client receives a message.  If "
"you have a large number of clients (several thousands), this can cause a "
"high CPU load on the {productname} Server.  If the CPU load is excessive, we "
"recommend that you delete keys in batches, and in off-peak hours if "
"possible, to avoid overloading the server."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ AES key ຖືກໝູນວຽນແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບ master ຄືນໃໝ່. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (ຫຼາຍພັນເຄື່ອງ), ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ CPU load ໃນ {productname} Server ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າ CPU load ສູງເກີນໄປ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລຶບຄີເປັນຊຸດ (batches) ແລະ ເຮັດໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານໜາແໜ້ນ (off-peak hours) ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/large-deployments/operation-reqs.adoc:39
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:20
msgid "For more information, see:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
