#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/faq/faq-miscellaneous.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where can I find out more about {productname}?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສ?"

