msgstr "Password: `<ລະຫັດຜ່ານ>`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:25
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:25
