#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:26
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and wait for the sync to finish."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create] ແລ້ວລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:27
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Proceed to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] to access your {payg} SUSE "
"Linux Enterprise products."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE Linux Enterprise ແບບ {payg} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Now that you have established connections to the {productname} {payg} "
"instance you can register them as clients. To learn how to register various "
"clients see: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[Client "
"Registration Methods]"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເພື່ອສຶກສາວິທີລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ]"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining the {productname} Server {payg} Public Cloud Image on {aws}"
msgstr "ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} Server {payg} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະຂອງ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the {productname} "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on {aws}.  You can also review the latest "
"available images for the public cloud using Pint (Public Cloud Information "
"Tracker)."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາອິມເມຈ {productname} {productnumber} {payg} ໃນ {aws}. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບອິມເມຈລ່າສຸດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Pint (Public Cloud Information Tracker)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
msgid "For more information see: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່: link:https://pint.suse.com/[pint.suse.com]"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtaining the {productname} {payg} Image on {aws}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In your browser navigate to the link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS "
"Management Console]."
msgstr "ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ລິ້ງ: link:https://aws.amazon.com/console/[AWS Management Console]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
msgid "Enter your AWS credentials and login."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ AWS ຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
msgid ""
"From the AWS Management Console dashboard, locate the menu:Services[] "
"dropdown."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າແດຊບອດ AWS Management Console, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາເມນູເລືອກ:Services[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
msgid "From the menu select menu:EC2[] under the **Compute** section."
msgstr "ຈາກເມນູ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເມນູ:EC2[] ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ **Compute**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the EC2 dashboard, in the main content section, you'll find the "
"btn:[Launch Instance] button. Click it."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າແດຊບອດ EC2, ໃນສ່ວນເນື້ອຫາຫຼັກ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນປຸ່ມ btn:[Launch Instance]. ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"From the **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)** page.  Select **Browse "
"more AMIs**."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ **Choose an Amazon Machine Image (AMI)**, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ **Browse more AMIs**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "Search for **{productname}**."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳວ່າ **{productname}**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid "Depending on your location select your AMI image."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິມເມຈ AMI ຕາມສະຖານທີ່ (Location) ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (EU and UK only)**\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະ EU ແລະ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} Server Family (non-EU and non-UK-only)**.\n"
msgstr "**{productname} Server Family (ສະເພາະນອກ EU ແລະ ນອກ UK ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "Click btn:[Select]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Select]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid "Proceed for image configuration."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການກຳນົດຄ່າອິມເມຈຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:1
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{aws} System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {aws}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When setting up a {productname} {payg} instance on {aws}, it is essential to "
"consider system requirements for optimal performance and functionality.  The "
"default requirements outlined below have been tailored for smooth deployment "
"and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {aws}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບ ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍ."

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; Use the **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** systems or newer \n"
"\n"
"| Memory\n"
"| 32 GB (minimum 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration\n"
"| Typically configured by your organization\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮາກ)\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ spacewalk)\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ)\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores; ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ **m5a**, **m5i**, **m6a**, **m6i** ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ \n"
"\n"
"| Memory (ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ)\n"
"| 32 GB (ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration (ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ)\n"
"| ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Log in and Update the System"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid "SSH into your {AWS} instance."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ເຂົ້າຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {AWS} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo -i\n"
"transactional-update\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo -i\n"
"transactional-update\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:29
msgid "Reboot the system."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່ (Reboot)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Configure storage with the `mgr-storage-server` tool or in the case of the "
"proxy use [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For more information, see [command]``mgr-storage-server --help`` or "
"[command]``mgr-storage-proxy --help``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:9
msgid "This tool simplifies creating the container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄອນເທນເນີ (Container storage) ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (Database volumes) ເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid "Format the command in the following manner:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server <storage-disk-device> [<database-disk-device>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:73
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc:55
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This command will create the following persistent storage volumes at "
"[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-server-setup.adoc:17
msgid "Run `mgradm install podman <FQDN>` as root."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `mgradm install podman <FQDN>` ໃນຖານະ root."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {payg} {webui} Configuration "
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} {payg} "

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:2
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} must be setup and running on {aws}.  For more information on "
"finding and setting up {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc[Public "
"Cloud Images]."
msgstr "{productname} ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ {aws}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຊອກຫາ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-public-cloud-images.adoc[Public Cloud Images]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instance-flavor-check tool and {payg} Schedule Check "
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check ແລະ ການກວດສອບຕາຕະລາງ {payg} "

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "instance-flavor-check Tool"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື instance-flavor-check"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The **instance-flavor-check** tool is an essential component that comes "
"pre-installed by default.  Its presence is crucial, as it determines the "
"status of {payg} instances.  When invoked, this tool identifies and "
"categorizes the system as a {payg} instance.  By default this tool is "
"configured to run on a schedule named **update-payg-default**."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື **instance-flavor-check** ແມ່ນອົງປະກອບທີ່ສຳຄັນເຊິ່ງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ມັນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ ເພາະມັນເປັນຕົວຊີ້ບອກສະຖານະຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ແບບ {payg}. ເມື່ອຖືກຮຽກໃຊ້, ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະລະບຸ ແລະ ຈັດປະເພດລະບົບວ່າເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg}. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຕາມກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ **update-payg-default**."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "update-payg-default Schedule Task"
msgstr "ງານຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ update-payg-default"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Admin[Task Schedules] to find the "
"**update-payg-default** task.  By default, this task is set to run at "
"10-minute intervals.  Its primary function is to monitor the presence of all "
"running {payg} instances by executing the **instance-flavor-check tool**."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Task Schedules] ເພື່ອຊອກຫາວຽກ **update-payg-default**. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວຽກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກທຸກໆ 10 ນາທີ. ໜ້າທີ່ຫຼັກຂອງມັນແມ່ນ ຕິດຕາມການມີຢູ່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື **instance-flavor-check**."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:9
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to the {webui}"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {webui}"

#. type: Block title
