#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Logging in"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Login to the {productname} Server {webui}.  Use the username and password "
"you have defined during the setup with [command]``mgradm install podman``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:12
