msgstr "**ຜະລິດຕະພັນຟຣີ (Free products)**\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:22
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu and Debian"
msgstr "Ubuntu ແລະ Debian"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:23
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:23
msgid "Ubuntu and Debian are not currently supported by our RMT servers."
msgstr "Ubuntu ແລະ Debian ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:24
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-webui-configuration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Red Hat Linux Enterprise Clients"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ Red Hat Linux Enterprise"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"{productname} offers support for {rhel} clients.  However, it is important "
"to note that content still needs to be added manually and is not available "
"through the cloud-based RMT service."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel}. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄວນໝາຍເຫດໄວ້ວ່າ ເນື້ອຫາຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (manual) ແລະ ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ບໍລິການຜ່ານບໍລິການ RMT ເທິງຄລາວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/aws/payg-aws-webui-configuration.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information see: "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[Red Hat Client "
"Registration]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່: xref:client-configuration:registration-overview-redhat.adoc[ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ Red Hat]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initial Preparation and Configuration of the {azure} Managed Application"
msgstr "ການກຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໃນ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers initial preparation and configuration of the Managed "
"Application on {azure}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາການກຽມການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ Managed Application ໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring your {productname} instance"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There are two tabs you need to fill out: _Basics_ and _Virtual Machine "
"Settings_."
msgstr "ມີຢູ່ສອງແຖບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ: _Basics_ (ພື້ນຖານ) ແລະ _Virtual Machine Settings_ (ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ)."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fill Out the _Basics_ Tab"
msgstr "ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຖບ _Basics_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:6
msgid "Project Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດໂຄງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:7
msgid ""
"As with every resource in Azure, you need to provide a _Resource Group_ "
"(RG). This can be an existing RG or you can create a new RG for this "
"deployment."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບທຸກໆຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ Azure, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ _Resource Group_ (RG). ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນ RG ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ສ້າງ RG ໃໝ່ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:8
msgid "Instance Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:9
msgid "Region – where the instance should run."
msgstr "ພາກພື້ນ (Region) – ບ່ອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:10
msgid "Virtual Machine Name – the name of the VM in which {productname} will run."
msgstr "ຊື່ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (Virtual Machine Name) – ຊື່ຂອງ VM ທີ່ {productname} ຈະເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:11
msgid "Username – the administrator account for the {productname} VM."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Username) – ບັນຊີຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບສຳລັບ VM ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:12
msgid "SSH Key Source and Key – needed to access the machine."
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາຂອງຄີ SSH ແລະ ຄີ (SSH Key) – ຈຳເປັນໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:13
msgid ""
"We do not allow the use of a password here. This is to reduce the risk of "
"brute force attacks."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນສ່ວນນີ້ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງຈາກການໂຈມຕີແບບ Brute Force."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:14
msgid "Managed Application Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (Managed Application)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:15
msgid "Application Name – the name of the Managed Application."
msgstr "ຊື່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (Application Name) – ຊື່ຂອງ Managed Application."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Managed Resource Group (MRG) – where the {productname} VM and its resources "
"will be deployed into."
msgstr "Managed Resource Group (MRG) – ບ່ອນທີ່ VM ຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໄປ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to the _Virtual Machine Settings_ Tab"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ແຖບ _Virtual Machine Settings_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:18
msgid "Instance Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instance Size)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The default for the instance size is _D8as v5_, which is a good baseline for "
"a production server. It provides enough resources for more data disks and "
"IOPS throughput for disk and network."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ແມ່ນ _D8as v5_, ເຊິ່ງເປັນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ດີສຳລັບເຊີເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ. ມັນໃຫ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນພຽງພໍສຳລັບການເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ IOPS ສຳລັບດິສກ໌ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:20
msgid "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/dasv5-dadsv5-series"
msgstr "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-machines/dasv5-dadsv5-series"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you only need a test instance, you can go smaller and choose an instance "
"size with 4 vCPUs and 16GB memory or use a _B-Series (Burstable)_ instance "
"with a similar configuration."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ສຳລັບທົດສອບ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຂະໜາດທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ ຂະໜາດທີ່ມີ 4 vCPUs ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ 16GB ຫຼື ໃຊ້ແບບ _B-Series (Burstable)_ ທີ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:22
msgid "Diagnostic Storage Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການວິນິດໄສ (Diagnostic Storage Account)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you normally create a VM in the Azure portal, boot diagnostics are "
"enabled by default using a managed storage account. You can choose an "
"existing storage account or create a new one (default)."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງ VM ໃນພອດທັລ (Portal) ຂອງ Azure ຕາມປົກກະຕິ, boot diagnostics ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຜ່ານບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື ສ້າງໃໝ່ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:24
msgid "OS Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ OS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:25
msgid "This is the root disk of the {productname} installation, which holds:"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ຮາກ (root disk) ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງຈະເກັບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:26
msgid "The OS and the {productname} application."
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (OS) ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:27
msgid ""
"[path]``/var/cache`` – where you need to provide storage space for each "
"product you want to manage."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:28
msgid "The proposed default of 100GB should be accepted."
msgstr "ຄວນຍອມຮັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແນະນຳຄື 100GB."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:29
msgid "Database Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This holds the Database for {productname} and needs a minimum of 50GB. The "
"proposed value of 80GB is a good default suggestion."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 50GB. ຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳ 80GB ຖືວ່າເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:31
msgid "Spacewalk Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດດິສກ໌ Spacewalk"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:32
msgid ""
"This holds the package repositories and should have at least "
"100GB. Additional requirements include:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຄັງແພັກເກັດ (Package repositories) ແລະ ຄວນມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 100GB. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດເພີ່ມເຕີມລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:33
msgid "50GB for every SUSE product."
msgstr "50GB ສຳລັບທຸກໆຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ SUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:34
msgid ">360GB for every RedHat or other Linux product."
msgstr ">360GB ສຳລັບທຸກໆຜະລິດຕະພັນ RedHat ຫຼື Linux ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:35
msgid "The proposed default of 500GB is a safe default to start with."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແນະນຳ 500GB ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ປອດໄພໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Repository synchronization will fail if this directory runs out of disk "
"space."
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຄັງຊອບແວ (Repository synchronization) ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ຫາກພື້ນທີ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີເຕັມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:37
msgid "Public IP Address for the VM"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະ (Public IP Address) ສຳລັບ VM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:38
msgid ""
"By default, a Public IP Address is created to access the {productname} VM "
"and Application."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ VM ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "*If you use it, please ensure this is secure and access is limited.*\n"
msgstr "*ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ງານມັນ, ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າມັນມີຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ.*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security "
"measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the "
"instance. SUSE strongly advises against a globally accessible {productname} "
"instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານ {productname} ເທິງຄລາວສາທາລະນະ ໝາຍເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. ມັນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈຳກັດ, ຄັດກອງ, ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. SUSE ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດວ່າບໍ່ຄວນປ່ອຍໃຫ້ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກ ໂດຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີລະບົບຄວາມປອດໄພບໍລິເວນຂອບເຂດທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:41
msgid ""
"You should carefully consider this, as the {productname} Server will have "
"access to all managed nodes. If someone gains access to {productname}, it "
"would mean access to all managed nodes as well. Threat actors actively scan "
"for accessible machines with open management ports (e.g., SSH or RDP), "
"especially on cloud providers."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາເລື່ອງນີ້ໃຫ້ລະອຽດ, ເພາະວ່າ {productname} Server ຈະມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆໂນດທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ. ຫາກມີໃຜບຸກລຸກເຂົ້າສູ່ {productname} ໄດ້, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກເຂົາຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໂນດທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຫວັງດີມັກຈະສະແກນຫາເຄື່ອງທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານພອດຈັດການທີ່ເປີດໄວ້ (ເຊັ່ນ SSH ຫຼື RDP), ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:42
msgid ""
"A Network Security Group (NSG) is created by default if you choose to create "
"a Public IP. It only allows inbound SSH access via port 22 as a minimal "
"protection for the public IP."
msgstr "Network Security Group (NSG) ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກສ້າງ Public IP. ມັນຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH ຂາເຂົ້າຜ່ານພອດ 22 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຖືວ່າເປັນການປ້ອງກັນຂັ້ນຕໍ່າສຸດສຳລັບ Public IP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:43
msgid ""
"It is recommended to additionally restrict access to a defined list of "
"networks and allow Azure's virtual network to drop requests originating from "
"other networks."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງເພີ່ມເຕີມສະເພາະເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນຂອງ Azure ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມາຈາກເຄືອຂ່າຍອື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Furthermore, you can add Just-in-Time access and/or use the Azure Bastion "
"Service, Firewall, VPN, or private network methods to secure public access."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ Just-in-Time ແລະ/ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Azure Bastion Service, Firewall, VPN ຫຼື ວິທີເຄືອຂ່າຍສ່ວນຕົວ (Private network) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:45
msgid ""
"You can choose not to create a Public IP address (which is more secure), but "
"you will need to use other methods to access the created {productname} VM "
"and its Web UI for further configuration. Additionally, you must take care "
"of the DNS and ensure a correct FQDN."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP ໄດ້ (ເຊິ່ງຈະປອດໄພກວ່າ), ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີອື່ນ ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ VM ຂອງ {productname} ແລະ Web UI ຂອງມັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການ DNS ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ FQDN ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "DNS Prefix for the Public IP Address   \n"
msgstr "DNS Prefix ສຳລັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສາທາລະນະ   \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly. If the FQDN cannot "
"be resolved, it can cause issues in several {productname} components."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຕ້ອງສາມາດແປຊື່ FQDN ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຫາກບໍ່ສາມາດແປຊື່ FQDN ໄດ້, ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:48
msgid ""
"To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, "
"both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS "
"server. You also need to ensure that *reverse lookups* are correctly "
"configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດຖືກແປຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍລູກຂ່າຍ, ທັງເຄື່ອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ DNS ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ *reverse lookups* ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you use the Public IP address, a DNS name is automatically created from "
"Azure. You only need to ensure that a unique name is used. The default "
"suggestion creates one by including a random number to make the domain name "
"unique."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ Public IP, ຊື່ DNS ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ Azure. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊໍ້າກັບໃຜ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ແນະນຳຈະສ້າງຊື່ໂດຍການລວມເອົາຕົວເລກແບບສຸ່ມ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຊື່ໂດເມນນັ້ນເປັນເອກະລັກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:50
msgid ""
"If you do not use the Public IP, you need to make sure that your setup can "
"resolve the FQDN correctly as mentioned above."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໃຊ້ Public IP, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານສາມາດແປຊື່ FQDN ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:51
msgid "Virtual Network / Subnet"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ / ຊັບເນັດ (Virtual Network / Subnet)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:52
msgid ""
"You will see a default proposal for a virtual network where {productname} "
"will reside. By clicking _edit_, you can adjust it to your needs."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນບ່ອນທີ່ {productname} ຈະຢູ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກ _edit_ ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Remember that a _Managed Application_ will be deployed from SUSE to your "
"Azure tenant. Therefore, this network is the network in the _Managed "
"Resource Group (MRG)_ and cannot overlap with existing networks."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມວ່າ _Managed Application_ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຈາກ SUSE ໄປຍັງ Azure tenant ຂອງທ່ານ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນ _Managed Resource Group (MRG)_ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຊໍ້າຊ້ອນກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:54
msgid ""
"At a later stage, you need to peer this network to the network with the "
"nodes you want to manage. Alternatively, you can create the managed nodes "
"within this network."
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ (peering) ເຂົ້າກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີໂນດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການ. ຫຼືອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໂນດທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໄວ້ພາຍໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:55
msgid ""
"With all fields filled out, press _Next_ or _Create_. The Azure portal will "
"perform a final check and provide a summary screen of this deployment."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄົບທຸກຊ່ອງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດ _Next_ ຫຼື _Create_. Azure portal ຈະເຮັດການກວດສອບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ ສະແດງໜ້າສະຫຼຸບຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If everything is correct, press _Create_ to deploy the _Managed Application_ "
"for {productname}."
msgstr "ຫາກທຸກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ _Create_ ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ _Managed Application_ ສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "After Deployment"
msgstr "ຫຼັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:58
msgid "After the VM is deployed, you can access it via SSH."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກ VM ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໄດ້ຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-configure-the-image.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that since this is a {payg} image, you will be billed according "
"to your actual usage, including the number of systems you **manage** and "
"**monitor** with this instance. It's essential to regularly track and review "
"your usage to prevent unexpected costs and ensure alignment with your needs."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມວ່າເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ແມ່ນອິມເມຈແບບ {payg}, ທ່ານຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຕາມການນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງ, ລວມທັງຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ** ດ້ວຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ນີ້. ມັນຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ກວດສອບການໃຊ້ງານຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Client connections and Client Registration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ {payg} ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing Connections and Registering {payg} and {byos} Images"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ການລົງທະບຽນອິມເມຈແບບ {payg} ແລະ {byos}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Registering {payg} instances with the {scclongform} or your own RMT server "
"will create conflicts that are not easily solved**.  \n"
"{payg} instances are automatically registered against the correct update "
"server when added to your cloud service provider {productname} instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ການລົງທະບຽນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ກັບ {scclongform} ຫຼື ເຊີເວີ RMT ຂອງທ່ານເອງ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຂັດແຍ່ງທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຍາກ**. \n"
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {payg} ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນກັບເຊີເວີອັບເດດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting Up Additional {payg} {suse} Products in {azure}"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມໃຊ້ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ແບບ {payg} ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ {azure}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Establishing a {payg} {sle} Connection With {productname} {payg}"
msgstr "ການສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} {sle} ກັບ {productname} {payg}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Once you have started up your {productname} {payg} instance and refreshed "
"products you can add **{payglongform} connections** via the menu:Admin[Setup "
"Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go] button.  This action links "
"your {productname} {payg} instance with additional {payg} products on "
"{azure}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລະ ອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payglongform}** ໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູ:Admin[Setup Wizard > Pay-as-you-go] ໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[+Add Pay-as-you-go]. ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ຂອງທ່ານ ເຂົ້າກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ອື່ນໆໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] and click the "
"btn:[+Add {payglongform}] button."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payglongform}] ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[+Add {payglongform}]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Now that you have established connections to the {productname} {payg} "
"instance you can register them as clients.  To learn how to register various "
"clients see: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[Client "
"Registration Methods]"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນພວກມັນເປັນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ເພື່ອສຶກສາວິທີລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່: xref:client-configuration:registration-methods.adoc[ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ]"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion Timeouts"
msgstr "ການໝົດເວລາຂອງ Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Inbound and outbound connections to {azure} are released after 4 minutes of "
"being idle.  This affects minion connectivity, especially when your "
"{productname} server is in {azure} and you have some on-premises minions.  "
"If a connection is idle for more than 4 minutes, connectivity is lost."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກໃນ {azure} ຈະຖືກຕັດຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເປັນເວລາ 4 ນາທີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ minion, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອເຊີເວີ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນ {azure} ແລະ ທ່ານມີ minion ບາງສ່ວນຢູ່ໃນສູນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົນເອງ (on-premises). ຫາກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ດົນເກີນ 4 ນາທີ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຫຼົຸດອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:32
msgid "To resolve this issue on your minions:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ໃນ minion ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Create a new configuration file at "
"i.a. [path]`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/keepalive.conf` and enable "
"[literal]`keepalive`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 5\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 5\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-connections-and-bootstrapping.adoc:36
msgid "Restart the [literal]`venv-salt-minion service`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining the {productname} Server {payg} Public Cloud Image on {azure}"
msgstr "ການຂໍຮັບອິມເມຈ {productname} Server {payg} ໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະຂອງ {azure}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Follow these step-by-step instructions to locate the {productname} "
"{productnumber} {payg} image on {azure}."
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເພື່ອຊອກຫາອິມເມຈ {productname} {productnumber} {payg} ໃນ {azure}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:3
msgid "Firstly, log in to your Azure account, via https://portal.azure.com"
msgstr "ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບບັນຊີ Azure ຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານ https://portal.azure.com"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This makes sure that the Azure system is able to identify in which country "
"your account get billed."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າລະບົບ Azure ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ວ່າບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຢູ່ໃນປະເທດໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is important, as billing for {productname} {payg} is handled via the "
"Azure Marketplace.  As there are restrictions on which countries this "
"listing can be billed, the account you will transact to should be the one "
"you are logged into."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນ ເພາະການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ແມ່ນຈັດການຜ່ານ Azure Marketplace. ເນື່ອງຈາກມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດວ່າລາຍການນີ້ສາມາດຄິດໄລ່ເງິນໄດ້ໃນປະເທດໃດແດ່, ບັນຊີທີ່ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ເຮັດທຸລະກຳ ຄວນເປັນບັນຊີດຽວກັບທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:6
msgid "There are currently two offers for {productname} {payg} on {azure}:"
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນມີສອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີສຳລັບ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {azure}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "** {productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders only)**\n"
msgstr "** {productname} {productnumber} ພ້ອມການສະໜັບສະໜູນ 24x7 (ສະເພາະການສັ່ງຊື້ໃນ EMEA ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**{productname} {productnumber} with 24x7 Support**\n"
msgstr "**{productname} {productnumber} ພ້ອມການສະໜັບສະໜູນ 24x7**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Pick the listing that reflects in which country your Azure account gets "
"billed. It depends on the _sold to address_ of the account, see "
"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile."
msgstr "ເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັບປະເທດທີ່ບັນຊີ Azure ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ. ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບທີ່ຢູ່ _ຜູ້ຊື້ (sold to address)_ ຂອງບັນຊີ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cost-management-billing/manage/change-azure-account-profile."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Do *not* go directly to the Azure Marketplace and get the offer. Even if the "
"offers are visible, they should not be selected from here, as the Azure Web "
"page is not able to identify your billing account. *Always log into the "
"portal first*"
msgstr "**ຢ່າ** ໄປທີ່ Azure Marketplace ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີຢູ່, ກໍບໍ່ຄວນເລືອກຈາກບ່ອນນັ້ນ ເພາະໜ້າເວັບ Azure ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸບັນຊີການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. *ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Portal ກ່ອນສະເໝີ*"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:11
msgid "After you are logged into the Azure Portal, click btn:[Create a resource]."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Azure Portal ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create a resource]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Enter {productname} {productnumber} into the search field on the top and "
"press kbd:[RETURN]"
msgstr "ປ້ອນ {productname} {productnumber} ລົງໃນຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາທາງດ້ານເທິງ ແລ້ວກົດ kbd:[RETURN]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:13
msgid ""
"You get a list of offerings and need to select the version of _{productname} "
"{productnumber} with 24x7 Support_ depending on your billing country."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງເລືອກເວີຊັນຂອງ _{productname} {productnumber} ພ້ອມການສະໜັບສະໜູນ 24x7_ ໃຫ້ກົງກັບປະເທດທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For example, for an account billed in Germany, it would be _{productname} "
"{productnumber} with 24x7 Support (EMEA Orders Only)_."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສຳລັບບັນຊີທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ເງິນໃນເຢຍລະມັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ _{productname} {productnumber} ພ້ອມການສະໜັບສະໜູນ 24x7 (ສະເພາະການສັ່ງຊື້ໃນ EMEA ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:15
msgid "The offer show up as _Azure Application_ and not as a _Virtual Machine_"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຈະສະແດງເປັນ _Azure Application_ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ _Virtual Machine_"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Click the description text to get the Product description and then on "
"btn:[Plans + Pricing]. If this is shown with a description and plan, you "
"have chosen the right offer. If there is nothing shown you selected the "
"wrong one."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Plans + Pricing]. ຫາກມີລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ແຜນລາຄາສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຂໍ້ສະເໜີຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຫຍັງສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຜິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:17
msgid "Next, click on the btn:[Create_ button]"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ btn:[Create]"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-public-cloud-images.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This will bring you to a form similar you may know from creating other Azure "
"resources.  There are two tabs you need to fill _Basic_ and _Virtual Machine "
"Settings_"
msgstr "ລະບົບຈະນຳທ່ານໄປຫາແບບຟອມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການສ້າງຊັບພະຍາກອນ Azure ອື່ນໆ. ມີສອງແຖບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄື _Basic_ ແລະ _Virtual Machine Settings_"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Azure System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ Azure"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} offering in Azure need to communicate with the "
"Azure Billing API, therefore it is not a simple virtual machine (VM) "
"offering."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ {productname} {payg} ໃນ Azure ຕ້ອງມີການສື່ສານກັບ Azure Billing API, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ສະເໜີແບບເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM) ທຳມະດາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Azure has created the Managed Application offering for this use case.  For "
"more information, see "
"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/managed-applications/overview."
msgstr "Azure ໄດ້ສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີແບບ Managed Application ສຳລັບກໍລະນີນຳໃຊ້ນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-resource-manager/managed-applications/overview."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture Diagram of a managed application"
msgstr "ແຜນຜັງໂຄງສ້າງຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "architecture of a managed application"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "AzureManagedApp.svg"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application resource group"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (Application resource group)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This resource group ( in the diagram _ResGroup A_ ) holds the managed "
"application instance, which could be translated as the metadata or "
"definition of the offering. It can only contain a single resource."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ (ໃນແຜນຜັງຄື _ResGroup A_) ຈະເກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ managed application ເອົາໄວ້, ເຊິ່ງປຽບເໝືອນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) ຫຼື ຄຳນິຍາມຂອງຂໍ້ສະເໜີນັ້ນ. ມັນສາມາດບັນຈຸໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ຊັບພະຍາກອນດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"A customer has full access to the resource group and uses it to manage the "
"life cycle of the managed application."
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຈັດການວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງ managed application."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed resource group (MRG)"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ (Managed resource group - MRG)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This resource group ( in the diagram _MRG_ ) holds all the resources that "
"are required by the managed application. For example, an application's "
"virtual machines, storage accounts, and virtual networks."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້ (ໃນແຜນຜັງຄື _MRG_) ຈະເກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ managed application. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ, ບັນຊີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:12
msgid ""
"A _managed application_ is similar to a solution template in Azure "
"Marketplace, with a few key differences:"
msgstr "_managed application_ ມີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັບແມ່ແບບໂຊລູຊັນ (solution template) ໃນ Azure Marketplace, ແຕ່ມີຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The resources are deployed into a _managed resource group_ that is normally "
"managed by the application's publisher."
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນ _managed resource group_ ເຊິ່ງໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ (publisher)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:14
msgid ""
"It is present in the customer's subscription, but an identity in the "
"publisher's tenant can be given access to the managed resource group."
msgstr "ມັນມີຢູ່ໃນການສະໝັກໃຊ້ຂອງລູກຄ້າ, ແຕ່ສາມາດມອບສິດໃຫ້ກັບຕົວຕົນ (identity) ໃນ tenant ຂອງຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ managed resource group ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The publisher's _management access_ and the customers _deny assignment_ are "
"optional."
msgstr "_ສິດໃນການຈັດການ_ ຂອງຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລະ _ການປະຕິເສດການມອບໝາຍ_ ຂອງລູກຄ້າ ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:16
msgid ""
"There are different permission scenarios available. SUSE is using here the "
"_Customer managed_ to give our customers of SUSE Manager full control."
msgstr "ມີຮູບແບບການກຳນົດສິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃຫ້ເລືອກ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້ SUSE ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ _Customer managed_ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຂອງ SUSE Manager ມີອຳນາດຄວບຄຸມຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customer managed"
msgstr "ຈັດການໂດຍລູກຄ້າ (Customer managed)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Customer"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:19
msgid "Customer has full access to the solution (in the managed resource group)"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຊລູຊັນຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ (ພາຍໃນ managed resource group)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "The customer manages the solution"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການໂຊລູຊັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ (Publisher)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "The publisher has no access to manage the solution."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງເພື່ອຈັດການໂຊລູຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The publisher develops the application and publishes on Azure Marketplace "
"but does not manage the application."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ເປັນຜູ້ພັດທະນາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນ Azure Marketplace ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຜູ້ຈັດການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:24
msgid ""
"The publisher licenses the application for billing through Azure "
"Marketplace."
msgstr "ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ອອກໃບອະນຸຍາດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເພື່ອການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນຜ່ານ Azure Marketplace."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When setting up a {productname} {payg} instance on {azure}, it's essential "
"to consider system requirements for optimal performance and "
"functionality. The default requirements outlined below have been tailored "
"for smooth deployment and operation."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {azure}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບ ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານເປັນໄປຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:27
msgid ""
"By default, certain disks are automatically generated when establishing a "
"{productname} {payg} instance on {azure}. To complete the setup of these "
"disks, use the **mgr-storage-server** tool."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ດິສກ໌ບາງສ່ວນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃນ {azure}. ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື **mgr-storage-server**."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "{azure} System Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງລະບົບສຳລັບ {azure}"

#. type: Table
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-requirements.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Requirement | Details\n"
"\n"
"| root storage\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores\n"
"\n"
"| Memory\n"
"| 32 GB (minimum 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration\n"
"| Typically configured by your organization\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ | ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
"\n"
"| root storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮາກ)\n"
"| 100 GB\n"
"\n"
"| spacewalk storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ spacewalk)\n"
"| 500 GB\n"
"\n"
"| database storage (ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ)\n"
"| 80 GB\n"
"\n"
"| CPU\n"
"| 4 cores\n"
"\n"
"| Memory (ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ)\n"
"| 32 GB (ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 16 GB)\n"
"\n"
"| Network Configuration (ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍ)\n"
"| ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນກຳນົດໂດຍອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Within the Managed Resource group you have set up, you will find the virtual "
"machine. To get the details, click on the name of the virtual machine.  Here "
"you can see the (public) IP address which you need to connect to the running "
"instance. SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນ Managed Resource group ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ. ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP (ສາທາລະນະ) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ເຂົ້າຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {azure} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:4
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system ."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr ""

#.  (Azure requirement, not ours).
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Remember, the {productname} {payg} setup requires, that a new Virtual "
"Network and a new subnet is configured, which was performed in the previous "
"step."
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມວ່າ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {payg} ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ Virtual Network ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຊັບເນັດ (Subnet) ໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ດຳເນີນການແລ້ວໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Because {productname} {payg} is deployed as a 'Managed Application' it is "
"not possible to deploy into an existing network."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ {productname} {payg} ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບແບບ 'Managed Application', ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before moving on to the next step, ensure the network is correctly "
"configured:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When you setup new clients which should be managed, take care that you put "
"them into the private subnet which is configured with {productname} {payg} "
"or peer your networks."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ນຳພວກມັນໄປໄວ້ໃນຊັບເນັດສ່ວນຕົວ (Private subnet) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ກັບ {productname} {payg} ຫຼື ເຮັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ເຂົ້າຫາກັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you want to manage systems in an already existing network, you must "
"configure **peering**."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການລະບົບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄ່າ **ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering)**."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[Azure "
"documentation]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ link:https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/virtual-network/tutorial-connect-virtual-networks?tabs=portal#create-virtual-network-peer[ເອກະສານຂອງ Azure]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Network Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure the network configuration aligns such that `hostname -f` yields the "
"identical name as the reverse DNS lookup of the private IP address. For "
"instance, when executing `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Insert the private IP with its Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) into "
"`/etc/hosts`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ IP ສ່ວນຕົວ ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ FQDN ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/hosts`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "`10.0.0.4   _instancename.location_.internal.cloudapp.azure.com`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/sysconfig/network/config` and append "
"`internal.cloudapp.azure.com` to `NETCONFIG_DNS_STATIC_SEARCHLIST`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Execute `netconfig update`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Subsequently, `hostname -f` should return the same FQDN as obtained from "
"`nslookup 10.0.0.X`."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄຳສັ່ງ `hostname -f` ຄວນສະແດງຊື່ FQDN ດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກ `nslookup 10.0.0.X`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When adding new virtual machines (VMs), such as {sles}, it's crucial to "
"ensure that they are configured within the same subnet as the {productname} "
"instance, or that you have setup network peering.  This step is essential "
"for successful network setup and integration."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (VM) ໃໝ່ ເຊັ່ນ {sles}, ມັນສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊັບເນັດດຽວກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname}, ຫຼື ທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ (peering) ແລ້ວ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຄືອຂ່າຍປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Additionally, be mindful of the geographical restrictions associated with "
"your plans.  Make sure to utilize the appropriate Azure accounts which "
"correspond to the specific geographic zones of your project."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ລະວັງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງພູມສາດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແຜນການຂອງທ່ານ. ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ບັນຊີ Azure ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບເຂດພູມສາດສະເພາະຂອງໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Storage"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Storage"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:26
msgid "SSH into your {azure} instance."
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ເຂົ້າຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {azure} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:27
msgid "Switch to the root user and update the system:"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ແລະ ອັບເດດລະບົບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:30
msgid "Configure storage using the appropriate tool:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:31
msgid "For a standard setup, use [command]``mgr-storage-server``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:32
msgid "For a proxy configuration, use [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:33
msgid "For more details, run:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"
msgstr ""
"mgr-storage-server --help\n"
"mgr-storage-proxy --help\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:35
msgid "These tools simplify the creation of container storage and database volumes."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການສ້າງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:36
msgid "Identify the block devices:"
msgstr "ລະບຸອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Block devices):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"
msgstr "ls /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:38
msgid "This command lists the disks created during deployment. Typically:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ດິສກ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:39
msgid "`lun3` is the storage disk."
msgstr "`lun3` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:40
msgid "`lun4` is the database disk."
msgstr "`lun4` ແມ່ນດິສກ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:41
msgid "Configure storage using the identified devices:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"
msgstr "mgr-storage-server /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun3 /dev/disk/azure/scsi1/lun4\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:43
msgid "This command creates persistent storage volumes at:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງວໍລຸມເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຖາວອນທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:44
msgid "[path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"For more details, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Deploy using `mgradm` as root:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ `mgradm` ໃນຖານະ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/azure/payg-azure-server-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install podman <FQDN>\n"

