#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Limitations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງ {payg}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Onboarded {byos} Instances without {scc} Credentials"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Valid {scclongform} credentials are needed to manage {byoslongform} ({byos}) "
"instances of {suse} products in {productname} {payg}.  This applies to all "
"{suse} products except {productname} Proxy {byos}.  Without any {scc} "
"credentials, {productname} {payg} will not allow onboarding any of the "
"mentioned {byos} instances.  The user will get an error."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scclongform} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byoslongform} ({byos}) ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນ {suse} ໃນ {productname} {payg}. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນກັບທຸກໆຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງ {suse} ຍົກເວັ້ນ {productname} Proxy {byos}. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, {productname} {payg} ຈະບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ກ່າວມາ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"There is a possibility that the user has valid {scc} credentials set with "
"already synced-up channels and the {byos} onboarded, but at some point "
"decides to delete those credentials."
msgstr "ມັນອາດເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນ {scc} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ ລວມທັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມ {byos} ເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງພັດຕັດສິນໃຈລົບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the scenario of having already onboarded {byos} instances but no {scc} "
"credentials set, the following restrictions apply:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປແລ້ວ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ {scc}, ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະມີຜົນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"A warning message will be shown to the user to let them know that they will "
"not be able to manage those instances."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຊາບວ່າ ພວກເຂົາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to be managed neither "
"through {salt} or Salt-SSH.  This applies to individual server management, "
"SSM and action-chains.  When dealing with several servers at once, as long "
"as there is one non-compliant {byos} instance among them, the entire "
"action/action-chain will be aborted for all servers."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ທັງຜ່ານ {salt} ຫຼື Salt-SSH. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຈັດການເຊີເວີແບບລາຍເຄື່ອງ, SSM ແລະ ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການ (action-chains). ເມື່ອຈັດການຫຼາຍເຊີເວີພ້ອມກັນ, ຫາກມີອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {byos} ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດພຽງແຕ່ເຄື່ອງດຽວ, ການດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນການທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກສຳລັບທຸກເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-limitations.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Non-compliant {byos} instances will not be able to access any repository "
"hosted in {productname} {payg} as long as {scc} credentials are not set.  "
"{productname} {payg} will return ``HTTP 401 Unauthorized`` until the "
"situation is amended, that is trying to install or upgrade packages using "
"zypper from those machines directly will not work."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{payg} Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ {payg}"

#. :keywords: Payg, Pay-as-you-go, AWS, Amazon Web Services, Azure, GCP, Google Cloud Compute,  cost-effective, scaling, Cloud Services, {productname}, Monitoring
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{payg} does not require a long-term subscription.  Users can leverage the "
"images of {productname} on a {payglongform} basis, paying only for the time "
"of use, and the number of managed and monitored systems.  {payg} with "
"{productname} is an optimal solution for those seeking control, convenience, "
"and cost savings when managing and monitoring their infrastructure on AWS, "
"Azure, and GCP."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to {payg}"
msgstr "ຄວາມຮູ້ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນກ່ຽວກັບ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"{productname} {payg} or {payglongform} is a flexible and cost-effective "
"solution that allows users to manage and monitor their systems from several "
"cloud services.  {payg} does not require a long-term subscription through "
"the {scclongform}.  Users can leverage images of {productname} on a "
"{payglongform} basis, paying only for the time of use, and the number of "
"**managed** and **monitored** systems."
msgstr "{productname} {payg} ຫຼື {payglongform} ແມ່ນໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ ແລະ ຄຸ້ມຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມລະບົບຂອງພວກເຂົາຈາກບໍລິການຄລາວຕ່າງໆ. {payg} ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວຜ່ານ {scclongform}. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ອິມເມຈຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ {payglongform}, ໂດຍຈ່າຍເງິນສະເພາະເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ ແລະ ຕາມຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກ **ຈັດການ** ແລະ **ຕິດຕາມ**."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{payg} with {productname} is an optimal solution for those seeking control, "
"convenience, and cost savings when managing and monitoring their "
"infrastructure on {awslongform}, {azure}, and {gcplongform}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtaining a {productname} Server Subscription (optional)"
msgstr "ການຂໍຮັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} Server (ທາງເລືອກ)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For customers running 10 or more {payg} SLES for SAP Applications instances "
"who also wish to access the {productname} {byos} Lifecycle subscription, an "
"email must be sent to susemanagerkey@suse.com.  The email should include "
"proof of at least 10 active SLES for SAP {payg} instances, such as a "
"screenshot of the relevant section of their cloud console.  The subscription "
"key is valid for one year and can be renewed by providing updated proof of "
"the instances at the end of the subscription period."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ງານອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SLES for SAP Applications ແບບ {payg} ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 10 ເຄື່ອງຂຶ້ນໄປ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງການສະໝັກໃຊ້ {productname} {byos} Lifecycle, ຕ້ອງສົ່ງອີເມວໄປທີ່ susemanagerkey@suse.com. ອີເມວຄວນລວມເອົາຫຼັກຖານການໃຊ້ງານອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ SLES for SAP {payg} ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 10 ເຄື່ອງ ທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບຖ່າຍໜ້າຈໍ (screenshot) ຂອງສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ໃນຄອນໂຊນຄລາວ (cloud console) ຂອງພວກເຂົາ. ຄີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (Subscription key) ຈະມີອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານໜຶ່ງປີ ແລະ ສາມາດຕໍ່ອາຍຸໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງຫຼັກຖານການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດໄລຍະເວລາການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benefits of Using {payg}"
msgstr "ປະໂຫຍດຂອງການໃຊ້ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The {productname} {payg} instance offers a flexible solution tailored to the "
"modern business landscape.  Key benefits include:"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ {productname} {payg} ໃຫ້ໂຊລູຊັນທີ່ຍືດຫຍຸ່ນ ເຊິ່ງອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຮູບແບບທຸລະກິດສະໄໝໃໝ່. ປະໂຫຍດຫຼັກໆ ລວມມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Cost Efficiency:* Pay only for what you use, aligning costs with the actual "
"system management needs.\n"
msgstr "*ຄວາມຄຸ້ມຄ່າດ້ານຕົ້ນທຶນ:* ຈ່າຍສະເພາະສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຈັດການລະບົບຕົວຈິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*No Subscription Required:* Eliminate the need for ongoing commitments or "
"long-term subscriptions, allowing for budget flexibility.\n"
msgstr "*ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສະໝັກໃຊ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ:* ຕັດຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການຜູກມັດ ຫຼື ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄລຍະຍາວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນດ້ານງົບປະມານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Ease of Use:* Utilize {productname}'s powerful features on a **{payg}** or "
"**{payglongform}** basis, streamlining initial setup and ongoing systems "
"management.\n"
msgstr "*ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍ:* ນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname} ໃນຮູບແບບ **{payg}** ຫຼື **{payglongform}**, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການຈັດການລະບົບຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເປັນໄປຢ່າງສະດວກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Scalability:* Easily scale the number of systems managed according to your "
"requirements, without worrying about subscription limitations.\n"
msgstr "*ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຂະຫຍາຍ:* ຂະຫຍາຍຈຳນວນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການສະໝັກໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Rapid Deployment:* Quickly run the image of your choice and begin managing "
"your systems, enhancing responsiveness to your needs.\n"
msgstr "*ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ວ່ອງໄວ:* ເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານອິມເມຈທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຈັດການລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທັນທີ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Integration with Cloud Services:* Leverage {productname} {payg} on {aws}, "
"{azure}, or {gcp} taking advantage of cloud infrastructure for an agile "
"systems management experience.\n"
msgstr ""

