#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up {productname} with Separate Disk for {byos}"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ໂດຍແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "ບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} setup results with an error while restarting services during "
"setup.  The setup fails on restarting [literal]``tomcat``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-error-1.png"
msgstr "tshoot-error-1.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "ເຫດຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When {productname} is set up using separate disks for cache, {postgresql} "
"and spacewalk, the existing data within these partitions are covered under "
"the new mount point."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ດິດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ cache, {postgresql} ແລະ spacewalk, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ພາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນ (partitions) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກວມເອົາພາຍໃຕ້ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount point) ໃໝ່."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-partitions.png"
msgstr "tshoot-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Because of this, data for certain services like tomcat go missing due to a "
"broken symbolic link."
msgstr "ຍ້ອນເຫດນີ້, ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບບາງບໍລິການເຊັ່ນ tomcat ຈຶ່ງຫາຍໄປເນື່ອງຈາກລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link) ຂາດ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"
msgstr "tshoot-broken-symlink.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:10
msgid ""
"As {productname} instance of cloud already has some services set up, when "
"the data is not available during set up it causes the service to not restart "
"as expected.  Therefore the setup fails."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ instance ຂອງ {productname} ເທິງ cloud ມີບາງບໍລິການທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຶ່ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-incomplete-files.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:12
msgid "Actual data which should be present:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ຄວນມີຢູ່:"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "tshoot-actual-files.png"
msgstr "tshoot-actual-files.png"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to Recreate"
msgstr "ວິທີສ້າງບັນຫາຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recreating the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງບັນຫາຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Server provisioned in {aws} uses relevant AMI for {byos}"
msgstr "{productname} Server ທີ່ຖືກຈັດກຽມໃນ {aws} ໂດຍໃຊ້ AMI ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບ {byos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Separate storage for spacewalk, {postgresql} and cache.  The size of the "
"partition depends on the repository to be synchronized."
msgstr "ແຍກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ spacewalk, {postgresql} ແລະ cache. ຂະໜາດຂອງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ repository ທີ່ຈະຊິງໂຄຣໄນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:18
msgid "Set up {productname} using [command]``yast2 susemanager_setup``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To resolve or avoid the issue, copy the data of the underlying partition "
"into the new partition by following the steps below:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນຂອງພາກສ່ວນເດີມລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນລຸ່ມນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving the issue"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:22
msgid "Create a backup partition"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາກສ່ວນ (partition) ສຳຮອງ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir /bkp\n"
msgstr "mkdir /bkp\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:24
msgid "Unmount the affected partition for example /var/cache."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Unmount) ພາກສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ເຊັ່ນ /var/cache."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "umount /var/cache\n"
msgstr "umount /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Check the underlying data in the partition.  This should list the actual "
"data present in the directory."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃນພາກສ່ວນດັ່ງກ່າວ. ເຊິ່ງຄວນຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:28
msgid "Copy the data onto the backup partition created in step 1."
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນສຳຮອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /var/cache/* /bkp/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:30
msgid "Mount the partition again using option 1 or 2:"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (Mount) ພາກສ່ວນຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກ 1 ຫຼື 2:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(option 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(option 2)   mount -a (if you have the entries under /etc/fstab)\n"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ 1)   /dev/nvme0nxx /var/cache\n"
"(ທາງເລືອກ 2)   mount -a (ຖ້າທ່ານມີລາຍການຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:32
msgid "Copy the backed up data from step 4 to the mounted partition"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 4 ໄປຍັງພາກສ່ວນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "cp -prav /bkp/* /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:34
msgid "Verify the data is present"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າມີຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls -l /var/cache/\n"
msgstr "ls -l /var/cache/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:36
msgid "Repeat the {productname} setup"
msgstr "ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"
msgstr "yast2 susemanager_setup\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/public-cloud-guide/troubleshooting/tshoot-public-cloud-setup-separate-disk-byos.adoc:39
msgid ""
"When using {productname} in public cloud with separate data partitions, make "
"sure that the existing data in those directories are copied onto the new "
"partition."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ public cloud ທີ່ມີການແຍກພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກຄັດລອກລົງໃນພາກສ່ວນໃໝ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ (Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses formulas with forms to configure your SAP clients.  There "
"are two formulas that you need to use:"
msgstr "{productname} ໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ (formulas) ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ SAP ຂອງທ່ານ. ມີສອງຟໍມູລາທີ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:3
msgid "``Hana`` to configure the HANA database"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:4
msgid "``Cluster`` to configure the clients into a cluster"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The formulas are provided by packages that you can download with your "
"package manager.  You need to install the formulas on the {productname} "
"Server.  When you have installed the package, you can use the {productname} "
"{webui} to enable and configure the formulas.  As you go through the formula "
"configuration process, provide details of the clients that contain your SAP "
"cluster, to set them up appropriately."
msgstr "ຟໍມູລາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍແພັກເກດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຟໍມູລາໃນ {productname} Server. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າຟໍມູລາ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟໍມູລາ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To install the formulas on the {productname} Server, use your package "
"manager to install these packages:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງຟໍມູລາໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:7
msgid "``saphanabootstrap-formula``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:8
msgid "``sapnwbootstrap-formula``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:9
msgid "``drbd-formula``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:10
msgid "``habootstrap-formula``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:11
msgid "``salt-shaptools``"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The order that you enable and configure the formulas is important.  You must "
"enable, configure, and apply the HANA formula first.  Then you can enable, "
"configure, and apply the cluster formula.  If you perform these steps in the "
"wrong order, your SAP installation fails."
msgstr "ລຳດັບການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟໍມູລາແມ່ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ HANA ກ່ອນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ cluster. ຖ້າທ່ານເຮັດຜິດຕາມລຳດັບນີ້, ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the HANA Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ HANA Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"click the client to use as the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງຫຼັກ (primary client) ໃນຄລັສເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Sap Hana "
"Deployment`` heading, and check the ``Saphanabootstrap`` formula in the "
"list.  Click btn:[Save] and apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Hana] tab, and "
"complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຟໍມູລາຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Formulas[Hana] ແລະ ກອກລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນໃນແບບຟອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  In the [guimenu]``Nodes`` sections, type "
"the short hostname of the client to install the HANA database or the "
"hostname you can retrieve on the command line with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"
msgstr "salt '<client-name>' grains.item host\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:19
msgid "Provide further details for the installation."
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate.  When the highstate is complete, you "
"can go on to apply the cluster formula."
msgstr "ກອກລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate. ເມື່ອ highstate ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການນຳໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ cluster ຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_hana_formula.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable and Configure the Cluster Formula"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ Cluster Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, locate the ``Cluster`` heading, "
"and check the ``Habootstrap`` formula in the list.  Click btn:[Save] and "
"apply the highstate to activate the formula."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_formulas.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:26
msgid ""
"When the formula is activated, navigate to the menu:Formulas[Cluster] tab, "
"and complete the details in the form."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຟໍມູລາຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Formulas[Cluster] ແລະ ກອກລາຍລະອຽດໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນໃນແບບຟອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Make sure you check [guimenu]``Install required packages`` to install "
"everything you need on the client.  Give your cluster a name, and specify "
"the hostname of the primary client in the cluster."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Complete the remaining details according to your environment, click "
"btn:[Save], and apply the highstate."
msgstr "ກອກລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫຼືອຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຄລິກ btn:[Save], ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/configure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "suma_sap_cluster_formula.png"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start: SAP Overview"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ່ວນ: ພາບລວມຂອງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide shows you how to use {productname} to install and configure "
"an SAP cluster.  It guides you through setting up a single {productname} "
"Server, preparing your client systems, and configuring the cluster using "
"formulas."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວິທີການໃຊ້ {productname} ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າ SAP cluster. ມັນຈະແນະນຳທ່ານຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server, ການກະກຽມລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າຄລັສເຕີໂດຍໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about SAP, see the SAP documentation at "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SAP, ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ SAP ໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about {productname}, see the {productname} "
"documentation at https://documentation.suse.com/suma."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparing Clients"
msgstr "ການກະກຽມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ (Clients)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Your SAP cluster requires several client systems.  Prepare your clients on "
"physical or virtual hardware, and ensure you have {sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP "
"installation media ready.  You cannot create an SAP cluster without the "
"{sles} SAP extension, as it provides tooling specific to SAP."
msgstr "SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ. ກະກຽມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໃນຮາດແວຈິງ ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງສະເໝືອນ (virtual), ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີແຜ່ນຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP ພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງ SAP cluster ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ {sles} SAP extension, ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າມັນມີເຄື່ອງມືສະເພາະສຳລັບ SAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One of the key features of SAP is high availability of the cluster.  Every "
"component within an SAP cluster has redundancy and failover protection.  "
"When you are preparing your clients, ensure you have enough hardware and "
"infrastructure to allow for this.  For more information about hardware "
"requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກຂອງ SAP ແມ່ນຄວາມພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສູງ (high availability) ຂອງຄລັສເຕີ. ທຸກໆອົງປະກອບພາຍໃນ SAP cluster ມີລະບົບສຳຮອງ ແລະ ການປ້ອງກັນການຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ (failover). ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກະກຽມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີຮາດແວ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານພຽງພໍສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຮາດແວ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sles-sap/15-SP4/html/SLES-SAP-installation/cha-plan.html#sec-hardware"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the clients you need to set up for an SAP "
"cluster, see https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ SAP cluster, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the {scclongform}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each client within your SAP cluster must be registered with the "
"{scclongform}.  To obtain your registration code, navigate to "
"https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser.  Log in to your {scc} "
"account, or follow the prompts to create a new account.  Click the "
"btn:[Subscriptions] tab to see the registration code.  When you install "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 for SAP the {unifiedinstaller} prompts you for the code."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນ SAP cluster ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນກັບ {scclongform}. ເພື່ອຂໍລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່. ຄລິກທີ່ແຖບ btn:[Subscriptions] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles}{nbsp}15 ສຳລັບ SAP, ລະບົບ {unifiedinstaller} ຈະຖາມຫາລະຫັດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about registering {productname} with {scclongform}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ {productname} ກັບ {scclongform}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the Clients for Clustering"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບການເຮັດ Clustering"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Every client system must have all the other client systems listed in their "
"[path]``/etc/hosts`` file.  Open the [path]``/etc/hosts`` file on each "
"client, and add the hostname for each of the other clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Shared Storage Device"
msgstr "ສ້າງອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນກາງ (Shared Storage Device)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Each of the clients needs to be able to access a shared disk.  The shared "
"disk can be physical hardware connected by ethernet, or you can set up a "
"virtual disk and access it with iSCSI."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງດິດສ່ວນກາງ (shared disk) ໄດ້. ດິດສ່ວນກາງນີ້ສາມາດເປັນຮາດແວຈິງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ ethernet, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າດິດສະເໝືອນ (virtual disk) ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ iSCSI ກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you use a virtual disk, consider hosting it on a separate system.  Do not "
"use a client machine to host the shared storage disk."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ດິດສະເໝືອນ, ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງມັນໄວ້ໃນລະບົບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ (client) ເພື່ອເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນກາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download the SAP Installation Software"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Download the SAP installation media and save a copy on each client.  The "
"software that you require differs depending on your environment.  For "
"example, if you are using HANA, you need the SAP HANA platform.  If you are "
"using Netweaver, you need different packages.  These software packages are "
"provided by SAP, not by {suse}."
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ SAP ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ. ຊອບແວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ HANA, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ SAP HANA platform. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ Netweaver, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການແພັກເກດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງອອກໄປ. ແພັກເກດຊອບແວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ SAP, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure you have saved the installation software in the same file system "
"location on each client.  Alternatively, save it to a shared NFS drive."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ບັນທຶກຊອບແວຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນໃນທຸກໆເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຫຼື ອາດຈະບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ NFS ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Clients to Use Latest ``module.run``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Each client needs to be configured to use the latest version of "
"``module.run``.  On each of the client machines, open the "
"``/etc/salt/minion`` configuration file and add or edit this line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"
msgstr ""
"use_superseded:\n"
"  - module.run\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:19
msgid "Restart the ``salt-minion`` process to enable the changes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Additional Disks for HANA"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງດິດເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ HANA"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For the clients that are going to run the HANA database, you require an "
"additional storage device.  This device is used to store files required by "
"HANA, which are located in the [path]``/hana/`` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"We recommend that this storage device be at least 20{nbsp}GB.  For some "
"installations, you might require more, and it is possible to use multiple "
"disks to provide this storage.  For comprehensive hardware requirements, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມີຂະໜາດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 20{nbsp}GB. ສຳລັບບາງການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ດິດຫຼາຍໜ່ວຍຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້. ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/all[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to the Server"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍກັບເຊີບເວີ (Server)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:25
msgid ""
"First of all, make sure you have an activation key that is associated with "
"the ``SLE-Product-SLES_SAP15`` base channel.  For more information about "
"activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:26
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping].  Fill "
"in the appropriate details, and make sure you check the [guimenu]``Manage "
"System Completely via SSH`` checkbox.  In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` "
"field, select the SLES for SAP activation key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-clients.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about registering, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Server"
msgstr "ກະກຽມເຊີບເວີ (Server)"

#.  This section needs cleanup for containers!!!
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Before you start you need to deploy the {productname} Server.  The method "
"for deploying the {productname} Server varies depending on your hardware and "
"environment."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) {productname} Server. ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Server ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຮາດແວ ແລະ ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} is deployed using the `mgradm` command.  During the deployment "
"process, when you are prompted for which product to install, select "
"{productname} Server.  For more information about deploying the "
"{productname} Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/suma/server-deployment-suma.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You need to do some configuration to set up the {productname} {webui}.  In "
"your browser, navigate to the URL of the server, and configure your "
"administration access to the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}. ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ URL ຂອງເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບຈັດການ (administration) ຂອງ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Now you can use the {webui} to prepare software channels and activation keys "
"for your clients."
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອກະກຽມ software channels ແລະ activation keys ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, add the appropriate SAP channels: From the "
"{webui}, add [systemitem]``SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 for SAP``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the {productname} Server with the {scclongform}.  You can do "
"this using the {webui}.  Add the new channel to your activation key."
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ {productname} Server ກັບ {scclongform}. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານ {webui}. ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ activation key ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To check if a channel has finished synchronizing navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and select the [guimenu]``Products`` tab.  This "
"dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Software channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "Software channels ອາດຈະມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/qs-sap/prepare-server.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງໂຄຣໄນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໂຄນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄວ້ກ່ອນຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ງານ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Command"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt commands have three main components: target, function, and arguments.  "
"The calls are constructed in this format:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ມີສາມອົງປະກອບຫຼັກຄື: target, function, ແລະ arguments. ຮູບແບບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແມ່ນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"
msgstr "salt 'target' <function> [arguments]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The target defines the client, or group of clients, on which to run the "
"function."
msgstr "ເປົ້າໝາຍກຳນົດໄຄລເອັນ (client) ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຂອງໄຄລເອັນ ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການລັນຟັງຊັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:5
msgid "The function is the particular task to be run."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນແມ່ນໜ້າທີ່ສະເພາະທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:6
msgid "Arguments provide any extra data required by the function."
msgstr "Arguments ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ function ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Targets"
msgstr "Salt Targets (ເປົ້າໝາຍ Salt)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Salt command targets allow you to specify a client or group of clients.  "
"There are several different targets you can use."
msgstr "Salt command targets ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:10
msgid "List available grains on all clients:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການ grains ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-useful-commands.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' grains.ls\n"
msgstr "salt '*' grains.ls\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:12
msgid "Target a specific client:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'web1.example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Glob Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Glob"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:15
msgid "Target all clients using a particular domain:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ທຸກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດເມນສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt '*example.com' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:17
msgid "Target all clients using a particular label:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ທຸກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ label ສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt 'label*' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "List Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບລາຍຊື່ (List)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:20
msgid "Specify a flat list of clients, using their IDs:"
msgstr "ລະບຸລາຍຊື່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ ID ຂອງພວກເຂົາ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -L 'client_ID1, client_ID2, client_ID3' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regular Expression Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແບບ Regular Expression"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:23
msgid "You can also define targets with PCRE-compliant regular expressions:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ regular expressions ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ PCRE:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -E '(?!web)' test.ping\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "IP Address Targeting"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍດ້ວຍ IP Address"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:26
msgid "List available client IP addresses:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ IP address ຂອງເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"
msgstr "salt '*' network.ip_addrs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:28
msgid "Target a specific client IP address:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ IP address ສະເພາະ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S '172.31.60.74' test.ping\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:30
msgid "Target all clients on a subnet:"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໄປທີ່ທຸກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນ subnet:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"
msgstr "salt -S 172.31.0.0/16 test.ping\n"

#
#. This is general Linux info, not specific to the topic.
#. You can use the [command]``ip`` command to find the subnet mask in the format of ``192.168.1.1/24``:
#. ----
#. ip -o -f inet addr show | awk '/scope global/ {print $4}'
#. ----
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more on targeting, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/targeting/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Execution Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Salt (Salt Execution Modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you have specified a target, provide the module and function to execute "
"on the target."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸໂມດູນ ແລະ function ທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງເປົ້າໝາຍນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:35
msgid "Find which modules can be executed on the target:"
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າໂມດູນໃດແດ່ທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກເທິງເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' sys.doc\n"
msgstr "salt '*' sys.doc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For a full list of callable modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/modules/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Function Arguments"
msgstr "Arguments ຂອງ Salt Function"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:39
msgid "Functions accept arguments for any extra data."
msgstr "Functions ສາມາດຮັບ arguments ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For example, the [command]``pkg.install`` function requires an argument "
"specifying which package to install:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"
msgstr "salt '*' pkg.install yast2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:42
msgid ""
"You can provide more than one argument to a function, with spaces between "
"them.  For example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ argument ໃຫ້ກັບ function ໄດ້ໂດຍການຍະຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-command.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: "
"\"John\"}'\n"
msgstr "salt '*' cmd.run 'echo \"Hello: $FIRST_NAME\"' env='{FIRST_NAME: \"John\"}'\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-config-modules.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
