#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Depending on the size and spreadness of the environment where {productname} "
"is used some connectivity issues are possible.  There are no common "
"recommendations for all the possible use cases as the environments could be "
"very different expecially if public clouds instances are involved."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງຂວາງຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ {productname} ຖືກນຳໃຊ້, ບັນຫາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບາງຢ່າງອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ບໍ່ມີຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບທຸກໆກໍລະນີ ເນື່ອງຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມີການໃຊ້ public cloud instances."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minions Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Minions"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In case clients are losing the connection to the {productname} Server (or "
"{productname} Proxy if involved), they are unreachable from the "
"{productname} Server {webui} or with command line tools.  To understand such "
"a connection issue check if the client is not reachable from the "
"{productname} Server with [command]``salt MINION_ID test.ping``, while "
"[command]``venv-salt-call test.ping`` (or [command]``salt-call test.ping`` "
"if non-bundle {salt} is used on the client) is working fine on the client "
"side.  If this is the case, it is recommended to set "
"[literal]``tcp_keepalive`` parameters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The parameters with the values from the example below can be used as a "
"starting point to look for settings, which could prevent cases of connection "
"loss without restoring for some environments.  It is recommended to put the "
"parameters in the separate drop-in configuration file like "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf`` or "
"[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/tuning-keepalives.conf``, depending on the minion "
"type used on the client side."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Keepalive Parameters Example Values"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ZeroMQ now includes support for configuring SO_KEEPALIVE if supported by\n"
"# the OS. If connections between the minion and the master pass through\n"
"# a state tracking device such as a firewall or VPN gateway, there is\n"
"# the risk that it could tear down the connection the master and minion\n"
"# without informing either party that their connection has been taken "
"away.\n"
"# Enabling TCP Keepalives prevents this from happening.\n"
msgstr ""
"######      Keepalive settings        ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ດຽວນີ້ ZeroMQ ຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ SO_KEEPALIVE ຖ້າລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຮອງຮັບ.\n"
"# ຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງ minion ແລະ master ຜ່ານອຸປະກອນຕິດຕາມສະຖານະ\n"
"# ເຊັ່ນ firewall ຫຼື VPN gateway, ອາດຈະມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈະຖືກຕັດຂາດ\n"
"# ໂດຍທີ່ທັງສອງຝ່າຍບໍ່ຮູ້ຕົວ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ TCP Keepalives ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບັນຫານີ້.\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Overall state of TCP Keepalives, enable (1 or True), disable (0 or "
"False)\n"
"# or leave to the OS defaults (-1), on Linux, typically disabled. Default "
"True, enabled.\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# ສະຖານະໂດຍລວມຂອງ TCP Keepalives, ເປີດ (1 ຫຼື True), ປິດ (0 ຫຼື False)\n"
"# ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS (-1), ໃນ Linux ປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ True (ເປີດ).\n"
"tcp_keepalive: True\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How long before the first keepalive should be sent in seconds. Default "
"300\n"
"# to send the first keepalive after 5 minutes, OS default (-1) is typically "
"7200 seconds\n"
"# on Linux see /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 300\n"
"# ເພື່ອສົ່ງ keepalive ທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກ 5 ນາທີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OS (-1) ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ\n"
"# ໃນ Linux ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_time.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_idle: 10\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How many lost probes are needed to consider the connection lost. Default "
"-1\n"
"# to use OS defaults, typically 9 on Linux, see "
"/proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຈຳນວນການກວດສອບ (probes) ທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 9 ໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງ /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_probes.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_cnt: 3\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# How often, in seconds, to send keepalives after the first one. Default -1 "
"to\n"
"# use OS defaults, typically 75 seconds on Linux, see\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການສົ່ງ keepalive ຫຼັງຈາກອັນທຳອິດ (ເປັນວິນາທີ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ -1\n"
"# ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OS, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 75 ວິນາທີໃນ Linux, ເບິ່ງ\n"
"# /proc/sys/net/ipv4/tcp_keepalive_intvl.\n"
"tcp_keepalive_intvl: 10\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxies Connectivity"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Proxies"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:13
msgid ""
"[command]``salt-broker`` service is used on {productname} Proxies to forward "
"{salt} traffic between the {productname} Server and [command]``salt-minion`` "
"service used on the client side.  It is possible that "
"[command]``salt-broker`` and all the clients behind it could be affected "
"with the same issue as the clients directly connected to the {productname} "
"Server.  The issue could be fixed with the same parameters as recommended "
"for the minions, but specified in [path]``/etc/salt/broker`` on each "
"{productname} Proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:14
msgid ""
"{productname} Proxy connectivity can also suffer when the connectivity to "
"the {productname} Server is lost for a quite long interval.  In such a case "
"Proxy connected clients started to retry the authentication to the "
"[command]``salt-master`` service on the {productname} Server.  This "
"situation could be potentially dangerous because it could lead to collecting "
"large amount of ZeroMQ messages with authentication attemps in the interal "
"buffer of ZeroMQ sockets used inside the [command]``salt-broker`` service.  "
"Then, on restoring the connection to the [command]``salt-master`` all of the "
"pending messages will be pushed to it.  It could lead to the issues on "
"{productname} Server side with [command]``salt-master`` service, because it "
"could be impossible to serve all the cached requests in appropriate time or "
"even to the complete denial of the service."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To avoid such situation a set of tuning parameters is available.  As the "
"most important one, [option]``wait_for_backend`` should be set to "
"[literal]``True``.  This prevents opening the sockets for the clients behind "
"the proxy while the connectivity to the [command]``salt-master`` service is "
"not established.  In this case the messages from the clients are not "
"collected in the internal buffers.  ``drop_after_retries`` is setting the "
"number of retries before closing the sockets to drop the cached messages.  "
"The other parameters could help to fine tune the behavior for the "
"environment."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Setting timeouts, intervals and ``drop_after_retries`` to lower values are "
"making [command]``salt-broker`` service more aggressive on detecting the "
"connection loss to the [command]``salt-master``, so that it puts the clients "
"behind the proxy to the conditions closer as they are connected directly to "
"the {productname} Server.  Increasing the values could provide some benefits "
"in case if the network channel between the {productname} Proxy and "
"{productname} Server is not stable enough, the message buffering can provide "
"some flexibility while re-establishing the connection."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Values for Keepalive Parameters"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີ Keepalive"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# For more details about the following parameters check ZeroMQ "
"documentation:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# All of these parameters will be set to the backend sockets\n"
"# (from the salt-broker to the salt-master)\n"
msgstr ""
"######   ZeroMQ connection options    ######\n"
"############################################\n"
"# ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ໃຫ້ກວດສອບເອກະສານ ZeroMQ:\n"
"# http://api.zeromq.org/4-2:zmq-setsockopt\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ backend sockets\n"
"# (ຈາກ salt-broker ຫາ salt-master)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# connect_timeout (sets ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets how long to wait before timing-out a connect to the remote socket.\n"
"# 0 could take much time, so it could be better to set to more strict "
"value\n"
"# for particular environment depending on the network conditions.\n"
"# The value equal to 10000 is setting 10 seconds connect timeout.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"
msgstr ""
"# connect_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_CONNECT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໝົດເວລາ (timeout) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ socket ປາຍທາງ.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 10000 ໝາຍເຖິງກຳນົດ timeout ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ 10 ວິນາທີ.\n"
"connect_timeout: 3000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# reconnect_ivl (sets ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 100\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time before reconnection attempt on connection "
"drop.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"
msgstr ""
"# reconnect_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_RECONNECT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 100\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາກ່ອນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາດ.\n"
"reconnect_ivl: 1000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# This parameter is important for detection of loosing the connection.\n"
"# In case of value equal to 0 it is not sending heartbits.\n"
"# It's better to set to more relevant value for the particular "
"environment,\n"
"# depending on possible network issues.\n"
"# The value equal to 20000 (20 seconds) works good for most cases.\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_ivl (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_IVL)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ສຳຄັນສຳລັບການກວດສອບການຂາດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"# ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ຈະບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງ heartbits.\n"
"# ຄ່າ 5000 (5 ວິນາທີ).\n"
"heartbeat_ivl: 5000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (sets ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# default: 0\n"
"# value unit: milliseconds\n"
"# Sets the interval of time to consider that the connection is timed out\n"
"# after sending the heartbeat and not getting the response on it.\n"
"# The value equal to 60000 (1 minute) is considering the connection is "
"down\n"
"# after 1 minute of no response to the heartbeat.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"# heartbeat_timeout (ກຳນົດ ZMQ_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT)\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ມິນລິວິນາທີ\n"
"# ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໝົດເວລາ (timeout)\n"
"# ຫຼັງຈາກສົ່ງ heartbeat ແລ້ວບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບກັບ.\n"
"heartbeat_timeout: 10000\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# The following parameters are not related to ZeroMQ,\n"
"# but the internal parameters of the salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# default: -1\n"
"# value unit: number of retries\n"
"# Drop the frontend sockets of the salt-broker in case if it reaches\n"
"# the number of retries to reconnect to the backend socket.\n"
"# -1 means not drop the frontend sockets\n"
"# It's better to choose more relevant value for the particular "
"environment.\n"
"# 10 can be a good choise for most of the cases.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"
msgstr ""
"######   Other connection options    ######\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີລຸ່ມນີ້ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ ZeroMQ,\n"
"# ແຕ່ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີພາຍໃນຂອງ salt-broker.\n"
"# drop_after_retries\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: -1\n"
"# ຫົວໜ່ວຍ: ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ພະຍາຍາມໃໝ່\n"
"# ປິດ frontend sockets ຂອງ salt-broker ຫາກພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ຮອດຈຳນວນທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"
"drop_after_retries: 5\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-connectivity.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# default: False\n"
"# The main aim of this parameter is to prevent  collecting the messages\n"
"# with the open frontend socket and prevent pushing them on connecting\n"
"# the backend socket to prevent large number of messages to be pushed\n"
"# at once to salt-master.\n"
"# It's better to set it to True if there is significant numer of minions\n"
"# behind the salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"
msgstr ""
"# wait_for_backend\n"
"# ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: False\n"
"# ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສະສົມຂໍ້ຄວາມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ backend ໄດ້.\n"
"# ຄວນຕັ້ງເປັນ True ຫາກມີ minions ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍຢູ່ຫຼັງ salt-broker.\n"
"wait_for_backend: True\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt States"
msgstr "Custom Salt States"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can create your own custom Salt states with {productname} as centrally "
"managed configuration channels.  Custom states are stored as Salt state "
"files on the {productname} Server with a ``.sls`` extension."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a New Custom Salt Channel"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊ່ອງທາງ Custom Salt ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create and edit custom Salt state "
"files.  You must create a state channel first, with an initial state named "
"``init.sls``.  The ``init.sls`` file is used to reference all other state "
"files within the channel.  The custom states that you create using the "
"{webui} are stored on the {productname} Server in the the "
"[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt/<organization>/`` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:5
msgid ""
"After the channel is created with an ``init.sls`` file, you can write "
"additional state files in the {webui}.  Alternatively, you can upload "
"existing state files to use within your state channel, or import them from "
"other channels or clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Salt Channel and Initial State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Custom Salt Channel ແລະ State ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:23
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:29
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:52
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:53
msgid "Click btn:[Create State Channel]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create State Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:9
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  Use alphanumeric characters, "
"hyphens, and underscores.  Do not use spaces."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, type the contents of your "
"``init.sls`` state.  If you want to reference file templates in this "
"configuration channel, ensure your file starts by specifying the source of "
"the managed file, using this syntax:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"
msgstr ""
"file.managed:\n"
"  - source: salt://<org_name>/<channel_name>/etc/<ID>/<filename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid " Example custom state files are given later in this section.\n"
msgstr " ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ custom state ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:15
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Update Channel] to save your state.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Channel] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ state ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Additional Files to a Custom State Channel"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ Custom State Channel"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid " Click the name of the channel you want to add files to."
msgstr " ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:19
msgid ""
"To create a new file, click btn:[Create configuration file] and type the "
"contents of the file."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ຄລິກ btn:[Create configuration file] ແລະ ພິມເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To upload an existing file, click btn:[Upload Configuration Files] and "
"select the file to upload."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຄລິກ btn:[Upload Configuration Files] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະອັບໂຫຼດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:21
msgid ""
"To copy an existing file, click btn:[Import a File from Another Channel or "
"System] and select the file to copy."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຄລິກ btn:[Import a File from Another Channel or System] ແລະ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຄັດລອກ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:24
msgid "Click btn:[View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[View/Edit <filename>.sls File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:25
msgid "Make your changes to the file."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Update Configuration File] to save your state."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Configuration File] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ state ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can also manage revisions, compare the state to others in your "
"organization, and download the ``.sls`` file from this dialog."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Client to a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:30
msgid "Click the name of the state you want to assign a client to."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ state ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:31
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:32
msgid "Check the clients you want to assign."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:34
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt state modules, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt state modules, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/states/all/index.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Custom State Files"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ Custom State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:36
msgid ""
"This section contains some example custom state files.  Use these as a basis "
"for writing your own custom states."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບາງຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ custom state. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານໃນການຂຽນ custom states ຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Manage a File"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"my_config_change_id:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: /etc/my.conf\n"
"    - source: salt://example_org/example_channel/etc/my.conf\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: 644\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Package Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"
msgstr ""
"my_pkg_id:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - refresh: True\n"
"    - pkgs:\n"
"      - glibc\n"
"      - kernel-default\n"
"      - hello: 1.0-42\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Remote Command"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄຳສັ່ງໄລຍະໄກ (Remote Command)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"
msgstr ""
"ip_forward-on:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: echo \"1\" > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\n"
"    - onlyif:\n"
"      - test `cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward` -eq 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Service Management"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຈັດການບໍລິການ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"
msgstr ""
"time_service_id:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: chronyd\n"
"    - enable: True\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom State to Trust a GPG Key"
msgstr "Custom State ເພື່ອເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:46
msgid ""
"By default, operating systems trust only their own GPG keys when they are "
"installed, and do not trust keys provided by third party packages.  The "
"clients can be successfully bootstrapped without the GPG key being trusted.  "
"However, you cannot install new third party packages or update them until "
"the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຈະເຊື່ອຖືສະເພາະ GPG keys ຂອງຕົນເອງໃນເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື keys ທີ່ມາຈາກແພັກເກດຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມ. ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຮັດ bootstrap ໄດ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອຖື GPG key. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກດຈາກບຸກຄົນທີສາມໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າ keys ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Salt clients are set to trust {suse} tools channels GPG keys when they are "
"bootstrapped.  For all other clients and channels, you need to manually "
"trust third party GPG keys."
msgstr "Salt clients ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງ {suse} tools channels ເມື່ອເຮັດ bootstrap. ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອຖື GPG keys ຂອງບຸກຄົນທີສາມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If you are bootstrapping Salt clients from the {productname} {webui}, you "
"can use a custom Salt state to trust the GPG key."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrapping Salt clients ຈາກ {productname} {webui}, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ custom Salt state ເພື່ອເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting a GPG Key With a Custom Salt State"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອຖື GPG Key ດ້ວຍ Custom Salt State"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Locate the key that you need to trust.  Ensure you have the correct key, and "
"that you also have the fingerprint used to verify the key.  This information "
"is available from the vendor or, in some cases, from a key server."
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ key ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອຖື. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ມີ fingerprint ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຢັ້ງຢືນ key ນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງ ຫຼື ຈາກ key server ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Copy the key to a file location where the client can access it.  We "
"recommend saving it in the [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` directory, where "
"all user public files must be saved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:54
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Name`` field, type a name for your state.  For example, "
"``GPG Key Trusts``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:55
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a label.  For example, "
"``GPG_Key_Trusts``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, type a short description of the "
"configuration your state performs.  For example, ``Trusts GPG Keys for "
"CentOS``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SLS Contents`` field, create a state to retrieve the "
"appropriate key from the {productname} Server and trust it on the client.  "
"The exact contents of your state varies depending on your client operating "
"system.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"
msgstr ""
"rpm_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  cmd.run:\n"
"    - name: rpm --import https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
"    - unless: rpm -q gpg-pubkey-<key_id>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') "
"}}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"
msgstr ""
"deb_trust_gpg_key:\n"
"  mgrcompat.module_run:\n"
"    - name: pkg.add_repo_key\n"
"    - path: https://{{ salt['pillar.get']('mgr_server') }}/pub/<third-party-gpg>.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Alternatively, you can add GPG keys to a configuration channel, using a "
"managed file to deploy them directly on the client.\n"
"  In this case, you would use a local path to the key, rather than a URL.\n"
msgstr ""
"  ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ GPG keys ເຂົ້າໃນ configuration channel ໂດຍໃຊ້ managed file ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໂດຍກົງໃສ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍ.\n"
"  ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນີ້, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງແທນການໃຊ້ URL.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels] and click the name of the state you "
"want to assign a client to.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Configuration[Channels] ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຂອງ state ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Target Systems] tab and check the clients you "
"want to assign.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Systems[Target Systems] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe systems].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When the configuration file is next run on the client, the GPG key is "
"trusted.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໃນເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, GPG key ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອຖື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can manage your GPG keys from your own repository hosted "
"on an external file management system."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຈັດການ GPG keys ຈາກ repository ຂອງທ່ານເອງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນລະບົບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a custom state at highstate"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ custom state ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:68
msgid ""
"To apply a custom state at highstate create a mapping in "
"[path]``/srv/salt/top.sls``.  This short example maps the [literal]``test`` "
"state to the system group [literal]``12``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-custom-states.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"
msgstr ""
"# /srv/salt/top.sls\n"
"base:\n"
"  'group_ids:12':\n"
"    - match: pillar\n"
"    - test\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt File Locations and Structure"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂອງ Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are several ways to set up the Salt file structure.  This section "
"describes how Salt is supported and set up as part of {productname} Server.  "
"The main configuration file is "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Do not edit the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` configuration "
"file.  This file belongs to the [package]``spacewalk-setup`` package and is "
"marked as [literal]``%config``.  When {suse} updates the "
"[package]``spacewalk-setup`` package, the [path]``susemanager.conf`` file is "
"overwritten, and any customization is lost.  Instead, add your own "
"configuration file to the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` directory.  This "
"prevents the update process from deleting your settings from the main "
"[path]``susemanager.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Some settings from [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf`` that can "
"help with finding configuration options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed "
"in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"
msgstr ""
"# Configure different file roots. Custom salt states should only be placed in\n"
"# /srv/salt.\n"
"# ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນແຕະຕ້ອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"
"file_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /usr/share/salt-formulas/states\n"
"    - /usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states\n"
"    - /srv/susemanager/salt\n"
"    - /srv/salt\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be "
"placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"# Users should not touch other directories listed here.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"
msgstr ""
"# Configure different pillar roots. Custom pillar data should only be placed\n"
"# in /srv/pillar.\n"
"pillar_roots:\n"
"  base:\n"
"    - /srv/pillar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When you are working with [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``, be "
"aware that:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:8
msgid "Files listed are searched in the order they appear"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ປາກົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:9
msgid "The first matching file found is called"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:10
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt state data from five root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt state ຈາກຫ້າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This directory is shipped and updated with {productname} and includes "
"certificate setup and common state logic to be applied to packages and "
"channels."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບ ແລະ ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍ {productname}, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ແລະ state logic ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບແພັກເກດ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:17
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:28
msgid "Do not edit or add custom Salt data to this directory."
msgstr "ຫ້າມແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນ custom Salt ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:16
msgid ""
"These directories are shipped and updated with {productname} or additional "
"extensions.  They include states for Salt formulas."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບ ແລະ ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍ {productname} ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ພວກມັນລວມມີ states ສຳລັບ Salt formulas."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/susemanager/salt``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:19
msgid ""
"This directory is generated by {productname}, based on assigned channels and "
"packages for clients, groups, and organizations.  This directory will be "
"overwritten and regenerated.  It is the Salt equivalent of the {productname} "
"database."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname} ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ແພັກເກດທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ, ກຸ່ມ ແລະ ອົງກອນ. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບ ແລະ ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:21
msgid "Within this directory, each organization has a sub-directory."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້, ແຕ່ລະອົງກອນຈະມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLS File Directory Structure"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂຄງສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄຟລ໌ SLS"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... files needed by states (uploaded by users)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... other SLS files (created by users)...\n"
"For example:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # user created\n"
"│   │    ... other files needed by states ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # user created\n"
"            ... other SLS files ...\n"
msgstr ""
"├── manager_org_<org id>\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ states ຕ້ອງການ (ອັບໂຫຼດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"│   └── state.sls\n"
"         ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ (ສ້າງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້)...\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
"├── manager_org_TESTING\n"
"│   ├── files\n"
"│   │   └── motd     # ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ\n"
"│   │    ... ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆ...\n"
"│   └── motd.sls     # ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ\n"
"            ... ໄຟລ໌ SLS ອື່ນໆ ...\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "[path]``/srv/salt``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This directory is used for custom state data, modules, and related data.  "
"{productname} does not operate or use this directory directly.  The state "
"data in this directory is used by the client highstate, and is merged with "
"the total state result generated by {productname}.  Use this directory for "
"custom Salt data."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ custom state, modules ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນໃນນີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຜົນລັດ state ທັງໝົດທີ່ {productname} ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:26
msgid "The {productname} Server reads Salt pillar data from two root directories:"
msgstr "{productname} Server ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Salt pillar ຈາກສອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:27
msgid ""
"/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: This directory is generated by "
"{productname}.  It is shipped and updated together with {productname}."
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/pillar:: ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:29
msgid ""
"/srv/pillar:: By default, {productname} does not operate or use this "
"directory directly.  The custom pillar data in this directory is merged with "
"the pillar result created by {productname}.  Use this directory for custom "
"Salt pillar data."
msgstr "/srv/pillar:: ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ໂດຍກົງ. ຂໍ້ມູນ custom pillar ໃນນີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບ pillar ທີ່ {productname} ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-file-locations.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can use the [systemitem]``gitfs`` fileserver backend to serve Salt data "
"from git repositories.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-gitfs.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bind Formula"
msgstr "Bind Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Bind formula is used to configure the Domain Name System (DNS) on the "
"branch server.  POS terminals will use the DNS on the branch server for name "
"resolution of {saltboot} specific hostnames."
msgstr "Bind formula ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Domain Name System (DNS) ໃນ branch server. ເຄື່ອງ POS ຈະໃຊ້ DNS ໃນ branch server ເພື່ອແປງຊື່ hostname ສະເພາະຂອງ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are configuring the Bind formula for a branch server with a "
"dedicated internal network, check that you are using the same fully "
"qualified domain name (FQDN) on both the external and internal branch "
"networks.  If the FQDN does not match on both networks, the branch server "
"will not be recognized as a proxy server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind formula ສຳລັບ branch server ທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ FQDN ດຽວກັນທັງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກ ແລະ ພາຍໃນ. ຫາກ FQDN ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, branch server ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຮັບຮູ້ວ່າເປັນ proxy server."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The following procedure outlines a standard configuration with two zones.  "
"Adjust it to suit your own environment."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບມາດຕະຖານທີ່ມີສອງ zones. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Zone 1 is a regular domain zone.  Its main purpose is to resolve{saltboot} "
"hostnames such as TFTP, FTP, or Salt.  It can also resolve the terminal "
"names if configured."
msgstr "Zone 1 ແມ່ນ domain zone ປົກກະຕິ. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງຊື່ {saltboot} hostnames ເຊັ່ນ TFTP, FTP ຫຼື Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Zone 2 is the reverse zone of Zone 1.  Its main purpose is to resolve IP "
"addresses back to hostnames.  Zone 2 is primarily needed for the correct "
"determination of the FQDNs of the branch."
msgstr "Zone 2 ແມ່ນ reverse zone ຂອງ Zone 1. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອແປງ IP address ກັບມາເປັນ hostname."

#.  REMARK: this procedure is probably too long.  Where to split?
#.  REMARK: are these list items (`*`) substeps?  Or what?  Confusing.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-bind.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Bind with Two Zones"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Bind ດ້ວຍສອງ Zones"

