#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:30
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:49
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition flags`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` section, set these parameters for "
"[guimenu]``Partition 3``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p3``)."
msgstr ""

