#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition symbolic ID`` field, enter a custom name for the "
"partition (for example, [systemitem]``p4``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:41
