msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:42
msgid "This will ensure the partition uses up all remaining space."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ partition ຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ທັງໝົດທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:43
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device mount point`` field, select [systemitem]``/``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:44
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filesystem format`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``OS Image to deploy`` field, enter the name of the image to "
"deploy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Image version`` field, leave it empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:47
msgid "This will ensure you use the latest available version."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "Special Partition Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດ Partition ພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:52
msgid "The {saltboot} formula helps you with setting up special partition types."
msgstr "{saltboot} formula ຊ່ວຍເຈົ້າໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະເພດ partition ພິເສດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:53
msgid ""
"For terminal to be able to boot locally, either [systemitem]``BIOS grub`` or "
"[systemitem]``EFI`` partition must be configured."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "BIOS grub Partition"
msgstr "BIOS grub Partition"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:55
msgid ""
"A BIOS grub partition is needed for local booting from a `GPT` disk on "
"non-EFI machines.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."
msgstr "BIOS grub partition ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການບູດພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຈາກດິສກ໌ `GPT` ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ EFI. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BIOS_boot_partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:56
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:61
msgid "In the formula, enter the following options:"
msgstr "ໃນ formula, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 50\n"
"Partition Flags: bios_grub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:58
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:63
msgid "Leave the other fields empty."
msgstr "ປະຫ້ອງອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ວ່າງໄວ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "EFI Partition"
msgstr "EFI Partition"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:60
msgid ""
"An EFI partition is needed for local booting on EFI machines, "
"[guimenu]``Partition Table Type`` must be `GPT`.  For more information, see "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EFI_system_partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"
msgstr ""
"Partition Symbolic ID: p1\n"
"Partition Size (MiB): 500\n"
"Device Mount Point: /boot/efi\n"
"Filesystem Format: vfat\n"
"Partition Flags: boot\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Selection in {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການເລືອກດິສກ໌ໃນ {saltboot} Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When there is only one disk present on target hardware (including USB "
"drives), use an asterisk [systemitem]``*`` to automatically select the disk "
"device."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When there are multiple disks, use an asterisk [systemitem]``*`` in the "
"device path.  In this example, SATA disks are differentiated from USB disks:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"
msgstr ""
"/dev/disk/by-path/*-ata-1\n"
"/dev/disk/by-path/*usb*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the entered value does not contain [systemitem]``/``, the entered value "
"is automatically prepended by [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/``.  For example, "
"[systemitem]``\\*usb*`` is the same as [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/\\*usb*``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If you prefer to select specific devices, you can this format in the disk "
"device field:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເລືອກອຸປະກອນສະເພາະ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້ໃນຫ້ອງ disk device:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:70
msgid "symbolic names (for example: [path]``/dev/sda``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:71
msgid "by-path (for example: [path]``/dev/disk/by-path/..``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:72
msgid "by-id (for example: [path]``/dev/disk/by-id/...``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:73
msgid ""
"To see a list of available devices from the command prompt, press kbd:[Esc] "
"while waiting for key approval."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈາກ command prompt, ໃຫ້ກົດ kbd:[Esc] ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ລໍຖ້າການອະນຸມັດ key."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting the {saltboot} Formula"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ {saltboot} Formula"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "``msdos`` Disklabel Limitations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-saltboot.adoc:76
msgid ""
"On the ``msdos`` disk label, you can create a maximum of four primary "
"partitions.  Extended partitions are not supported.  If you need more than "
"four partitions, use the ``GPT`` disk label instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "TFTPd Formula"
msgstr "TFTPd Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The TFTPd formula is used to configure the TFTP service on the {productname} "
"{smr} branch server."
msgstr "TFTPd formula ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ TFTP ໃນ {productname} {smr} branch server."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring TFTP"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ TFTP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:6
msgid "Select the [systemitem]``Tftpd`` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:7
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Tftpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Tftpd], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Internal Network Address`` field, enter the IP address of "
"the branch server (for example: [systemitem]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``TFTP Base Directory`` field, enter the path to the "
"{saltboot} directory (for example, [systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-tftpd.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Run TFTP Under User`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``saltboot``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Guest Formula"
msgstr "Virtualization Guest Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Guest formula is used to configure settings for virtual "
"machine."
msgstr "Virtualization Guest formula ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ ຂອງ virtual machine."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Open the [guimenu]``Tuning`` pull-down checklist and select from the "
"following virtual machine performance tuning settings:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:4
msgid "[guimenu]``Disable IRQ balancing``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:5
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Disable Kernel Samepage Merging (KSM)``.  Reduces performance "
"overhead by not sharing memory across virtual machines."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:6
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``Optimizations for KVM passed through host CPU``.  Requires the "
"KVM hint-dedicated option to be set on the VM definition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-guest.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When configured, click btn:[Save Formula] to save your configuration, and "
"apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ highstate."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization Host Formula"
msgstr "Virtualization Host Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Virtualization Host formula is used to configure settings for a "
"virtualization host."
msgstr "Virtualization Host formula ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ ຂອງ virtualization host."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hypervisor"
msgstr "Hypervisor"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:4
msgid "Select KVM or Xen as the hypervisor."
msgstr "ເລືອກ KVM ຫຼື Xen ເປັນ hypervisor."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default storage pool"
msgstr "ສ້າງ storage pool ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create default virtual network"
msgstr "ສ້າງ virtual network ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Default pool: Open the pull-down list and enter the directory name of the "
"default storage pool."
msgstr "Default pool: ເປີດລາຍການລົງມາ ແລະ ປ້ອນຊື່ directory ຂອງ storage pool ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Default net: Open the pull-down list and configure the default virtual "
"network by setting the [guimenu]``Mode`` ([literal]``NAT`` or "
"[literal]``Bridge``) and the [guimenu]``Bridge name``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-virtualization-host.adoc:10
msgid "Enable IOMMU support (x86_64)."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ IOMMU (x86_64)."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "VsFTPd Formula"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The VsFTPd formula is used to configure the FTP service on the branch "
"server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring VsFTPd"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:5
msgid "Select the [systemitem]``Vsftpd`` formula, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:6
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Vsftpd] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``FTP server directory`` field, enter "
"[systemitem]``/srv/saltboot``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Internal Network Address`` field, enter the IP address of "
"the branch server (for example: [literal]``192.168.1.5``)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-vsftpd.adoc:9
msgid "All other fields can retain their default values."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Formula"
msgstr "Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The Yomi (yet one more installer) installer for {suse} and openSUSE "
"operating systems is configured using formulas with forms."
msgstr "Yomi (yet one more installer) ເຊິ່ງເປັນເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ {suse} ແລະ openSUSE ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ formulas ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:3
msgid "The ``yomi-formula`` package provides these formulas:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:4
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi"
msgstr "Yomi"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:5
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Storage"
msgstr "Yomi Storage"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:6
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Bootloader"
msgstr "Yomi Bootloader"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:7
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Software"
msgstr "Yomi Software"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:8
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Services"
msgstr "Yomi Services"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:9
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yomi Users"
msgstr "Yomi Users"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Install the Yomi Formulas with Forms"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Yomi Formulas ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:11
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"``yomi-formula`` package:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:12
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in yomi-formula\n"
msgstr "zypper in yomi-formula\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:13
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:27
msgid "Restart services:"
msgstr "Restart ບໍລິການ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-yomi.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-master.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-master.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When the formula package is installed, you need to install the PXE Yomi "
"image on the client, boot the client you want to provision, and enable the "
"Yomi formulas on the client.  For more information on preparing Yomi clients "
"for provisioning, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດ formula ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ PXE Yomi image ໃນ client, ບູດ client ທີ່ຕ້ອງການກຽມລະບົບ, ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ Yomi formulas ໃນ client ນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການກຽມ Yomi clients, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi] tab, and set these parameters in the "
"[guimenu]``General Configuration`` section:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:18
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Events`` box to allow monitoring."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Reboot`` field, select ``yes`` to instruct the client to "
"reboot after installation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Snapper`` box if you are using the btrfs file system on "
"the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Locale`` field, select the region and encoding for systemd "
"to use on the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:22
msgid "For example: ``en_US.utf8`` for US English and UTF-8."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:23
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Keymap`` field, select the appropriate keyboard layout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:24
msgid "For example: ``us`` for a US keyboard layout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Timezone`` field, select the timezone for the client to "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:26
msgid "For example: [guimenu]``America/New_York`` for EST."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Hostname`` field, enter the hostname for the client to "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:28
msgid "Leave this blank if you are using DHCP to provide the hostname."
msgstr "ປະວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ DHCP ເພື່ອຈ່າຍ hostname."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Machine Id`` field, enter a machine identification number "
"for the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:30
msgid "Leave this blank to have systemd generate one automatically."
msgstr "ປະວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ systemd ສ້າງໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:31
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Target`` field, enter a systemd target unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Storage Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Storage Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Storage] tab, and set these parameters in "
"the menu:Partitions[Config] section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Storage], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Config]:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Labels`` field, select the default partition table type to "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Initial Gap`` field, select the default amount of space to "
"leave before the first partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For example: ``1{nbsp}MB``, or use ``0`` to leave no space between "
"partitions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:38
msgid ""
"For each device that you want to configure, in the menu:Partitions[Devices] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Devices], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:39
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device`` field, type the mount point for the device."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:40
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:61
msgid "For example, ``/dev/sda``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, select the partition table type to use, if "
"it is different from the default label you selected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:42
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Initial Gap`` field, select the amount of space to leave "
"before the first partition, if it is different from the default space you "
"specified."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For each partition that you want to create, in the menu:Partitions[Devices > "
"Partitions] section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ partition ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Partitions[Devices > Partitions], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition Number`` field, enter a number for the "
"partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The number you enter here is appended to the device name to identify the "
"partition.  For example, partition number ``1`` on device ``/dev/sda`` can "
"be identified as ``/dev/sda1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:46
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition Name`` field, enter a name for the partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Leave this blank if you have entered a partition number in the previous "
"field."
msgstr "ປະວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກ partition ໃນຫ້ອງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:48
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Partition Size`` field, enter a size for the partition."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:49
msgid ""
"For example: ``500{nbsp}MB``.  Use ``rest`` to use all the remaining free "
"space."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For each file system that you want to create, in the "
"[guimenu]``Filesystems`` section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:51
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Partition`` field, select the partition to create the file "
"system on."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:52
msgid "For example, ``/dev/sda1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:53
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Filesystem`` field, select the file system type to create."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:54
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Mountpoint`` field, type the mount point for the file "
"system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:55
msgid "For example: ``/`` for root."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:57
msgid ""
"If you want to use LVM or RAID on your devices, click btn:[+] in the "
"appropriate sections, and complete the details for your environment."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ LVM ຫຼື RAID ໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+] ໃນພາກສ່ວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ແລະ ຕື່ມລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Bootloader Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Bootloader Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Bootloader] tab, and set these parameters "
"in the [guimenu]``Bootloader`` section:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:60
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Device`` field, type the path for the bootloader."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:62
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Timeout`` field, select the number of seconds grub will "
"wait before booting the default menu entry."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:63
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Kernel`` field, type any additional kernel parameters you "
"want to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Any kernel parameters you add here will be appended to the "
"``GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT`` line during boot."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Terminal`` field, type the terminal to use for both "
"terminal input and output."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:66
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Serial Command`` field, type parameters for using the "
"serial port."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:67
msgid "Use this only if you are using the serial console as the default terminal."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ serial console ເປັນ terminal ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Gfxmode`` field, type the resolution to use for the "
"graphical terminal."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Use this only if you are using the graphical console as the default "
"terminal."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ graphical console ເປັນ terminal ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:70
msgid "Check the [guimenu]``Theme`` box to use GRUB2 default branding package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Disable OS Prober`` box to disable using the OS prober "
"to discover other installed operating systems."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Software Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Software Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:74
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Software] tab, and set these parameters "
"in the menu:Software[Configuration] section:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Software], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Configuration]:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Minimal`` box to use a minimal installation, which only "
"installs packages listed as ``Required``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:76
msgid ""
"For each repository that you want to add, in the menu:Software[Repositories] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ repository ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Repositories], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:77
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Repository Name`` field, type a name for the repository."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Repository URL`` field, type the location of the "
"repository."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:79
msgid ""
"To add packages from each repository, in the menu:Software[Packages] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັກເກັດຈາກແຕ່ລະ repository, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Packages], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the menu:Software[Packages] field, type the names of the packages to "
"install, or type a pattern to search for the appropriate packages."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ menu:Software[Packages], ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ພິມຮູບແບບ (pattern) ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:81
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:96
msgid "For example, ``pattern:enhanced_base glibc-locale``, or ``kernel-default``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:82
msgid "In the menu:Software[Image] section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Software[Image], ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:83
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Image URL`` field, type the location of the operating "
"system ISO image to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:84
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Md5`` field, type the MD5 hash to use to verify the ISO."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:85
msgid "In the menu:SUSEConect[Config] section, set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:SUSEConect[Config], ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Registration Code`` field, type the registration code for "
"the client you are installing."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:87
msgid "You can obtain this code from {scclongform}."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເອົາລະຫັດນີ້ໄດ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:88
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Email`` field, type the administrator email address to "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:89
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Url`` field, type the address of the registration server "
"to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:90
msgid "For example, use ``https://scc.suse.com``, to register with {scclongform}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:91
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Version`` field, type the version of the product you are "
"registering."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For each product that you want to register, in the "
"menu:SUSEConnect[Products] section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນ, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:SUSEConnect[Products], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:93
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Product`` field, type each product you want to register."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:94
msgid ""
"For example, ``<product_name>/1.1/x86``, for version 1.1 with {x86} "
"architecture."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:95
msgid ""
"In the menu:SUSEConnect[Packages] field, type the names of the packages to "
"install, or type a pattern to search for the appropriate packages."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ menu:SUSEConnect[Packages], ໃຫ້ພິມຊື່ແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຫຼື ພິມຮູບແບບເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Services Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Services Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:99
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Services] tab, and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Services], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:100
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Install salt-minion`` box to install and configure the "
"client as a Salt client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:101
msgid ""
"For each service you want to enable, in the menu:Services[Enabled] section, "
"click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Services[Enabled], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:102
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Service`` field, type the name of the service to enable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:103
msgid "For example, ``salt-minion``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:104
msgid ""
"For each service you want to disable, in the menu:Services[Disabled] "
"section, click btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິການທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປິດໃຊ້, ໃນພາກສ່ວນ menu:Services[Disabled], ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[+], ແລະ ກຳນົດພະລາມິເຕີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:105
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Service`` field, type the name of the service to disable."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the Yomi Users Formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Yomi Users Formula"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:108
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Yomi Users] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Formulas[Yomi Users]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:109
msgid ""
"For each user you want to create, in the [guimenu]``Users`` section, click "
"btn:[+], and set these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:110
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Username`` field, type the name of the new user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:111
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Password Hash`` field, type the hashed version of the "
"password to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:112
msgid ""
"To add a certificate for each user, in the menu:Users[Certificates] section, "
"click btn:[+], and add the certificate to the [guimenu]``Certificate`` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formula-yomi.adoc:115
msgid ""
"For more information about using Yomi, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ Yomi, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-yomi.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulas Provided by {productname}"
msgstr "Formulas ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some formulas are installed by default with {productname}.  Other official "
"formulas can be installed as RPM packages.  When the formula is installed, "
"you can activate them using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ບາງ formulas ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພ້ອມກັບ {productname}. ສ່ວນ formulas ທາງການອື່ນໆ ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກັດ RPM. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ formula ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ຜ່ານ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For information about writing custom formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂຽນ custom formulas ເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Formulas with Zypper"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Formulas ດ້ວຍ Zypper"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:5
msgid "Formulas are provided in the {productname} pool software channel."
msgstr "Formulas ມີໃຫ້ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ software pool ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If a formula uses the same name as an existing Salt state, the two names "
"will collide, and could result in the formula being used instead of the "
"state.  Always check states and formulas to avoid name clashes."
msgstr "ຖ້າ formula ໃຊ້ຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ Salt state ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຊື່ທັງສອງຈະຕຳກັນ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ formula ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແທນ state. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ states ແລະ formulas ສະເໝີເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຊ້ຳຊ້ອນຂອງຊື່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Formulas with Zypper"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Formulas ດ້ວຍ Zypper"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, search for available "
"formulas:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ຄົ້ນຫາ formulas ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper se --type package formula\n"
msgstr "zypper se --type package formula\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:10
msgid "Get more information about a formula:"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formula:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper info <formula_name>\n"
msgstr "zypper info <formula_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, install the "
"formula:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນນາມ root, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ formula:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in <formula_name>\n"
msgstr "zypper in <formula_name>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate Formulas from the {webui}"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Formulas ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Formulas provided by {productname}, or formulas that you have installed, can "
"be activated using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Formulas ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}, ຫຼື formulas ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້, ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Activate Formulas from the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ເປີດໃຊ້ Formulas ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[List], select the "
"client you want to activate the formula for."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[List], ເລືອກ client ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ formula ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Systems[Formulas] tab, and check the formula you want "
"to activate."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Systems[Formulas], ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ formula ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Navigate to the new subtab for the formula, and configure the formula as "
"required."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍໃໝ່ຂອງ formula ນັ້ນ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ formula ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Salt Formulas"
msgstr "Custom Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about writing custom formulas, including "
"formulas with forms.  You can write your own custom formulas, and make them "
"available to client systems in the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂຽນ custom formulas ເອງ, ລວມທັງ formulas ພ້ອມກັບແບບຟອມ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂຽນ custom formulas ຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ, ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພວກມັນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບລະບົບ client ໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For information about the formulas provided by {productname}, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ formulas ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂດຍ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-by-product.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "File Structure Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:5
msgid ""
"RPM-based formulas must be placed in a specific directory structure to "
"ensure that they work correctly.  A formula contains two separate "
"directories: [path]``states``, and [path]``metadata``.  Folders in these "
"directories need to have exactly matching names."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The formula states directory contains anything necessary for a Salt state to "
"work independently.  This includes [path]``.sls`` files, a "
"[path]``map.jinja`` file and any other required files.  This directory "
"should only be modified by RPMs and should not be edited manually.  For "
"example, the [package]``locale-formula`` states directory is located in:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/locale/\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/locale/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To create formulas with forms, the metadata directory contains a "
"[path]``form.yml`` file.  The [path]``form.yml`` file defines the forms for "
"{productname}.  The metadata directory also contains an optional "
"[path]``metadata.yml`` file with additional information about the formula.  "
"For example, the [package]``locale-formula`` metadata directory is located "
"in:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you have a custom formula that is not in an RPM, it must be in a state "
"directory configured as a Salt file root.  Custom state formula data must be "
"in:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີ custom formula ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນ RPM, ມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ state directory ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ Salt file root. ຂໍ້ມູນ custom state formula ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/salt/<custom-formula-name>/\n"
msgstr "/srv/salt/<custom-formula-name>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:12
msgid "Custom metadata information must be in:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ custom metadata ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/\n"
msgstr "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:14
msgid ""
"All custom folders must contain a [path]``form.yml`` file.  These files are "
"detected as form recipes and are applied to groups and systems from the "
"{webui}:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/form.yml\n"
msgstr "/srv/formula_metadata/<custom-formula-name>/form.yml\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The Salt formula directory changed in {productname}{nbsp}4.0.  The old "
"directory location, [path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas``, will continue "
"to work for some time.  You should ensure that you update to the new "
"directory location, [path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/`` as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define Formula with Forms Data"
msgstr "ກຳນົດ Formula ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນແບບຟອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:18
msgid ""
"{productname} requires a file called [path]``form.yml``, to describe how "
"formula data should look within the {webui}.  The [path]``form.yml`` file is "
"used by {productname} to generate the desired formula with forms, with "
"values editable by a user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The file contains a list of editable attributes that start with a `$` sign.  "
"These attributes are used to determine how to display the formula in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ປະກອບມີລາຍການຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attributes) ທີ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `$`. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະສະແດງ formula ແນວໃດໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For example, the [path]``form.yml`` that is included with the "
"[package]``locale-formula`` is in:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/form.yml\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/metadata/locale/form.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:22
msgid "Part of that file looks like this:"
msgstr "ບາງສ່ວນຂອງໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນມີໜ້າຕາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"timezone:\n"
"  $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"timezone:\n"
"  $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  name:\n"
"    $type: select\n"
"    $values: [\"CET\",\n"
"              \"Etc/Zulu\"\n"
"              ]\n"
"    $default: CET\n"
msgstr ""
"  name:\n"
"    $type: select\n"
"    $values: [\"CET\",\n"
"              \"Etc/Zulu\"\n"
"              ]\n"
"    $default: CET\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  hardware_clock_set_to_utc:\n"
"    $type: boolean\n"
"    $default: True\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"  hardware_clock_set_to_utc:\n"
"    $type: boolean\n"
"    $default: True\n"
"...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:26
msgid ""
"All values that start with a `$` sign are annotations used to display the UI "
"that users interact with.  These annotations are not part of pillar data "
"itself and are handled as metadata."
msgstr "ທຸກຄ່າທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `$` ແມ່ນ annotations ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງ UI ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂຕ້ຕອບນຳ. annotations ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຈັດການໃນຖານະ metadata."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:27
msgid "This section lists the available attributes:"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມລາຍການຄຸນລັກສະນະ (attributes) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "$type"
msgstr "$type"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The most important attribute is the `$type` attribute.  It defines the type "
"of the pillar value and the form-field that is generated.  The supported "
"types are:"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ `$type`. ມັນກຳນົດປະເພດຂອງຄ່າ pillar ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນແບບຟອມທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:30
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:31
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:83
msgid "`password`"
msgstr "`password`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:32
msgid "`number`"
msgstr "`number`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:33
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:34
msgid "`email`"
msgstr "`email`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:35
msgid "`date`"
msgstr "`date`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:36
msgid "`time`"
msgstr "`time`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:37
msgid "`datetime`"
msgstr "`datetime`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:38
msgid "`boolean`"
msgstr "`boolean`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:39
msgid "`color`"
msgstr "`color`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:40
msgid "`select`"
msgstr "`select`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:41
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:42
msgid "`edit-group`"
msgstr "`edit-group`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:43
msgid "`namespace`"
msgstr "`namespace`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:44
msgid "`hidden-group` (obsolete, renamed to ``namespace``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The text attribute is the default and does not need to be specified "
"explicitly."
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະ text ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:46
msgid "Many of these values are self-explanatory:"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍຄ່າໃນນີ້ແມ່ນເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍດ້ວຍຕົວມັນເອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:47
msgid "The `text` type generates a simple text field"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `text` ຈະສ້າງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບທຳມະດາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:48
msgid "The `password` type generates a password field"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `password` ຈະສ້າງຫ້ອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:49
msgid "The `color` type generates a color picker"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `color` ຈະສ້າງເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:50
msgid ""
"The ``group``, ``edit-group``, and `namespace` (formerly ``hidden-group``) "
"types do not generate an editable field and are used to structure form and "
"pillar data.  All these types support nesting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The `group` and `namespace` types differ slightly.  The `group` type "
"generates a visible border with a heading.  The `namespace` type shows "
"nothing visually, and is only used to structure pillar data."
msgstr "ປະເພດ `group` ແລະ `namespace` ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ປະເພດ `group` ຈະສ້າງຂອບທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ພ້ອມກັບຫົວຂໍ້. ສ່ວນປະເພດ `namespace` ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຫຍັງໃຫ້ເຫັນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອຈັດໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:52
msgid ""
"The `edit-group` type allows you to structure and restrict editable fields "
"in a more flexible way.  The `edit-group` type is a collection of items of "
"the same kind.  Collections can have these four shapes:"
msgstr "ປະເພດ `edit-group` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຈັດໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຈຳກັດຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນແບບທີ່ຍືດຫຍຸ່ນກວ່າ. ປະເພດ `edit-group` ແມ່ນການລວມກຸ່ມຂອງລາຍການປະເພດດຽວກັນ. ການລວມກຸ່ມສາມາດມີ 4 ຮູບແບບຄື:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:53
msgid "List of primitive items"
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງ primitive items"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:54
msgid "List of dictionaries"
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງ dictionaries"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:55
msgid "Dictionary of primitive items"
msgstr "Dictionary ຂອງ primitive items"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:56
msgid "Dictionary of dictionaries"
msgstr "Dictionary ຂອງ dictionaries"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:57
msgid "The size of each collection is variable.  Users can add or remove elements."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະຄໍເລັກຊັນແມ່ນປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລົບອົງປະກອບອອກໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For example, `edit-group` supports the `$minItems` and `$maxItems` "
"attributes, which simplifies complex and repeatable input structures.  "
"These, and also `itemName`, are optional."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, `edit-group` ຮອງຮັບຄຸນລັກສະນະ `$minItems` ແລະ `$maxItems`, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄງສ້າງການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງເຮັດຊ້ຳນັ້ນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ລວມທັງ `itemName` ແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "$default"
msgstr "$default"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify a default value to be displayed.  This default value "
"will be used if no other value is entered.  In an `edit-group` it allows you "
"to create initial members of the group and populate them with specified "
"data."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລະບຸຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປ້ອນຄ່າອື່ນ. ໃນ `edit-group`, ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງສະມາຊິກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກຸ່ມ ແລະ ໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "$optional"
msgstr "$optional"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This type is a Boolean attribute.  If it is `true` and the field is empty in "
"the form, then this field will not be generated in the formula data and the "
"generated dictionary will not contain the field name key.  If it is `false` "
"and the field is empty, the formula data will contain a `<field name>: null` "
"entry."
msgstr "ປະເພດນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນລັກສະນະ Boolean. ຖ້າມັນເປັນ `true` ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງໃນແບບຟອມ, ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງໃນຂໍ້ມູນ formula ແລະ dictionary ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີ key ຂອງຊື່ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນ. ຖ້າມັນເປັນ `false` ແລະ ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງ, ຂໍ້ມູນ formula ຈະມີລາຍການ `<field name>: null` ປະກົດຢູ່."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "$ifEmpty"
msgstr "$ifEmpty"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:64
msgid ""
"This type is used if the field is empty.  This usually occurs because the "
"user did not provide a value.  The `ifEmpty` type can only be used when "
"`$optional` is `false` or not defined.  If `$optional` is `true`, then "
"`$ifEmpty` is ignored.  In this example, the `DP2` string would be used if "
"the user leaves the field empty:"
msgstr "ປະເພດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນວ່າງ. ປົກກະຕິເກີດຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ຄ່າ. ປະເພດ `ifEmpty` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ `$optional` ເປັນ `false` ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຖ້າ `$optional` ເປັນ `true`, `$ifEmpty` ຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ `DP2` ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ວ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"displayName:\n"
"  $type: string\n"
"  $ifEmpty: DP2\n"
msgstr ""
"displayName:\n"
"  $type: string\n"
"  $ifEmpty: DP2\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "$name"
msgstr "$name"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Allows you to specify the name of a value that is shown in the form.  If "
"this value is not set, the pillar name is used and capitalized without "
"underscores and dashes.  Reference it in the same section with "
"``pass:c[${name}]``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "$help and $placeholder"
msgstr "$help ແລະ $placeholder"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:69
msgid ""
"These attributes are used to give a user a better understanding of what the "
"value should be.  The `$help` type defines the message a user sees when "
"hovering over a field The `$placeholder` type displays a gray placeholder "
"text in the field"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າໃຈດີຂຶ້ນວ່າຄວນປ້ອນຄ່າຫຍັງ. ປະເພດ `$help` ກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະເຫັນເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ປະເພດ `$placeholder` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວຢ່າງສີເທີໃນຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Use `$placeholder` only with text fields like text, password, email or date "
"fields.  Do not add a placeholder if you also use `$default`, as it will "
"hide the placeholder."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `$placeholder` ສະເພາະກັບຫ້ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເຊັ່ນ text, password, email ຫຼື date ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບໍ່ຄວນເພີ່ມ placeholder ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ `$default` ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເພາະມັນຈະບັງ placeholder ໄວ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "$key"
msgstr "$key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Applicable only if the `edit-group` has the shape of a dictionary.  When the "
"pillar data is a dictionary, the `$key` attribute determines the key of an "
"entry in the dictionary."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອ `edit-group` ມີຮູບແບບເປັນ dictionary. ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ເປັນ dictionary, ຄຸນລັກສະນະ `$key` ຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດ key ຂອງລາຍການໃນ dictionary ນັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    $key:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"    $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    alice: secret-password\n"
"    bob: you-shall-not-pass\n"
msgstr ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    $key:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"    $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    alice: secret-password\n"
"    bob: you-shall-not-pass\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:75
msgid "Pillar:"
msgstr "Pillar:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  alice:\n"
"    secret-password\n"
"  bob:\n"
"    you-shall-not-pass\n"
msgstr ""
"user_passwords:\n"
"  alice:\n"
"    secret-password\n"
"  bob:\n"
"    you-shall-not-pass\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "$minItems and $maxItems"
msgstr "$minItems ແລະ $maxItems"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In an ``edit-group``, `$minItems` and `$maxItems` specifies the lowest and "
"highest numbers for the group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "$itemName"
msgstr "$itemName"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In an ``edit-group``, `$itemName` defines a template for the name to be used "
"for the members of the group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "$prototype"
msgstr "$prototype"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In an ``edit-group``, `$prototype` is mandatory and defines the default "
"pre-filled values for newly added members in the group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "$scope"
msgstr "$scope"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:84
msgid ""
"Specifies a hierarchy level at which a value may be edited.  Possible values "
"are ``system``, `group`, and ``readonly``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:85
msgid ""
"The default value is `$scope: system`, allows values to be edited at group "
"and system levels.  A value can be entered for each system but if no value "
"is entered the system will fall back to the group default."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `$scope: system`, ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າໄດ້ທັງໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ ແລະ ລະດັບລະບົບ. ສາມາດປ້ອນຄ່າໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະລະບົບໄດ້ ແຕ່ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປ້ອນຄ່າໃດໆ ລະບົບຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:86
msgid ""
"The ``$scope: group`` option makes a value editable only for a group.  On "
"the system level you will be able to see the value, but not edit it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:87
msgid ""
"The `$scope: readonly` option makes a field read-only.  It can be used to "
"show data to the user, but will not allow them to edit it.  This option "
"should be used in combination with the ``$default`` attribute."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "$visibleIf"
msgstr "$visibleIf"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:89
msgid "Deprecated in favor of `$visible`."
msgstr "ຖືກຍົກເລີກການນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍໃຫ້ໄປໃຊ້ `$visible` ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:90
msgid ""
"Allows you to show a field or group if a simple condition is met.  An "
"example condition is:"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານສະແດງຟີວ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຖ້າຫາກກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວຢ່າງເງື່ອນໄຂຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "some_group#another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr "some_group#another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:92
msgid ""
"The left part of the condition is the path to another value, and groups are "
"separated by `#` signs.  The middle section of the condition should be "
"either `==` for a value to be equal or `!=` for values that should be not "
"equal.  The last field in the statement can be any value which a field "
"should have or not have."
msgstr "ສ່ວນເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງເງື່ອນໄຂແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຄ່າອື່ນ, ແລະ ແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມຈະຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `#`. ສ່ວນກາງຂອງເງື່ອນໄຂຄວນເປັນ `==` ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ ຫຼື `!=` ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັນ. ສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍໃນຄຳສັ່ງສາມາດເປັນຄ່າໃດໆກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຟີວນັ້ນຄວນມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄວນມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:93
msgid ""
"The field with this attribute associated with it will be shown only when the "
"condition is met.  In this example the field will be shown only if "
"`my_checkbox` is checked.  The ability to use conditional statements is not "
"limited to check boxes.  It may also be used to check values of "
"select-fields, text-fields, and similar."
msgstr "ຟີວທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເງື່ອນໄຂກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ຟີວຈະຖືກສະແດງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ `my_checkbox` ຖືກເລືອກ (checked). ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງເງື່ອນໄຂບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດຢູ່ແຕ່ກັບ check boxes ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄ່າຂອງ select-fields, text-fields ແລະ ອື່ນໆທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:94
msgid "A check box should be structured like this:"
msgstr "Check box ຄວນມີໂຄງສ້າງແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:95
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:99
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:117
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:140
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:149
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"some_group:\n"
"  $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"some_group:\n"
"  $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:96
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:100
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:118
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:141
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"  another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:97
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:119
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      my_checkbox:\n"
"        $type: boolean\n"
msgstr ""
"      my_checkbox:\n"
"        $type: boolean\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:98
msgid ""
"Relative paths can be specified using prefix dots.  One dot indicates a "
"sibling, two dots indicate a parent, and so on.  This is mostly useful for "
"``edit-group``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:101
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_checkbox:\n"
"      $type: boolean\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_checkbox:\n"
"      $type: boolean\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visibleIf: .my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visibleIf: .my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:103
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  yet_another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"
msgstr ""
"  yet_another_group:\n"
"    $type: group\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visibleIf: ..another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visibleIf: ..another_group#my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:105
msgid ""
"If you use multiple groups with the attribute, you can allow a users to "
"select an option and show a completely different form, dependent upon the "
"selected value."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກຸ່ມຮ່ວມກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລ້ວສະແດງຟອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປເລີຍ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:106
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Values from hidden fields can be merged into the pillar data and sent to the "
"client.  A formula must check the condition again and use the appropriate "
"data.  For example:"
msgstr "ຄ່າຈາກຟີວທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ສາມາດຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຫາ client ໄດ້. ສູດ (formula) ຈະຕ້ອງກວດສອບເງື່ອນໄຂອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visibleIf: .show_option == true\n"
msgstr ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visibleIf: .show_option == true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:108
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar.show_option %}\n"
"do_something:\n"
"  with: {{ pillar.some_text }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar.show_option %}\n"
"do_something:\n"
"  with: {{ pillar.some_text }}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "$values"
msgstr "$values"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Can only be used together with ``$type`` Use to specify the different "
"options in the select-field.  `$values` must be a list of possible values to "
"select.  For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values: [\"option1\", \"option2\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values: [\"option1\", \"option2\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:112
msgid "Or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values:\n"
"    - option1\n"
"    - option2\n"
msgstr ""
"select_something:\n"
"  $type: select\n"
"  $values:\n"
"    - option1\n"
"    - option2\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "$visible"
msgstr "$visible"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Allows you to show a field or group if a condition is met.  You must use the "
"https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language to write the "
"condition."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານສະແດງຟີວ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຖ້າຫາກກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language ເພື່ອຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:116
msgid "Example structure:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໂຄງສ້າງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:120
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:143
msgid "An example condition is:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເງື່ອນໄຂຄື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:121
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "formValues.some_group.another_group.my_checkbox == true\n"
msgstr "formValues.some_group.another_group.my_checkbox == true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:122
msgid ""
"The field with this attribute will only show if the condition is met.  In "
"this example, the field will show only if ``my_checkbox`` is checked.  You "
"can also choose other elements for the conditional statement, such as select "
"fields or text fields."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:123
msgid ""
"If you use multiple groups with the attribute, users can select an option "
"that will show a completely different form, depending on the selected value."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກຸ່ມຮ່ວມກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຈະສະແດງຟອມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປເລີຍ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄ່າທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visible: this.parent.value.show_option == true\n"
msgstr ""
"show_option:\n"
"  $type: checkbox\n"
"some_text:\n"
"  $visible: this.parent.value.show_option == true\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "$disabled"
msgstr "$disabled"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:128
msgid ""
"Allows you to disable a field or group if a condition is met. You must use "
"the https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language to write the "
"condition."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານປິດການໃຊ້ງານຟີວ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມ ຖ້າຫາກກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language ເພື່ອຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:129
msgid "If specified at group level it will disable all fields in that group."
msgstr "ຫາກກຳນົດໃນລະດັບກຸ່ມ ມັນຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານທຸກຟີວໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "$required"
msgstr "$required"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:131
msgid ""
"Fields with this attribute are mandatory. Supports using the "
"https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expresion language."
msgstr "ຟີວທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ (mandatory). ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "$match"
msgstr "$match"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:133
msgid "Allows using a regular expression to validate the content of a text field."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ regular expression ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເນື້ອໃນໃນ text field."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:134
msgid "It supports the regular expression features existing in JavaScript."
msgstr "ມັນຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງ regular expression ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ JavaScript."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:135
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:10
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:14
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:18
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      hardware:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"        $name: Hardware Type and Address\n"
"        $placeholder: Enter hardware-type hardware-address (for example, "
"\"ethernet AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF\")\n"
"        $help: Hardware Identifier - prefix is mandatory\n"
"        $match: \"\\\\w+ "
"[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"      hardware:\n"
"        $type: text\n"
"        $name: Hardware Type and Address\n"
"        $placeholder: Enter hardware-type hardware-address (for example, \"ethernet AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF\")\n"
"        $help: Hardware Identifier - prefix is mandatory\n"
"        $match: \"\\\\w+ [A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}:[A-Z]{2}\"\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expression language"
msgstr "ພາສາສຳນວນ (Expression language)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:138
msgid ""
"You must use the https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language "
"to write conditions."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ https://github.com/TomFrost/jexl[jexl] expression language ເພື່ອຂຽນເງື່ອນໄຂ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:139
msgid "Given a structure like this:"
msgstr "ຈາກໂຄງສ້າງແບບນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:145
msgid "Absolute paths must begin with ``formValues``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:146
msgid ""
"Specify relative paths using ``this.parent.value`` to define the value of "
"the parent."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:147
msgid ""
"You can also refer to the parent of the parent, with "
"``this.parent.parent.value``.  This is mostly useful for ``edit-group`` "
"elements."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:148
msgid "Example for relative paths:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງແບບທຽບຖານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.value.my_checkbox\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.value.my_checkbox\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.parent.value.another_group.my_checkbox\n"
msgstr ""
"    my_text2:\n"
"      $visible: this.parent.parent.value.another_group.my_checkbox\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Basic edit-group"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: edit-group ແບບພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"partitions:\n"
"  $name: \"Hard Disk Partitions\"\n"
"  $type: \"edit-group\"\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $maxItems: 4\n"
"  $itemName: \"Partition ${name}\"\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"New partition\"\n"
"    mountpoint:\n"
"      $default: \"/var\"\n"
"    size:\n"
"      $type: \"number\"\n"
"      $name: \"Size in GB\"\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"Boot\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/boot\"\n"
"    - name: \"Root\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/\"\n"
"      size: 5000\n"
msgstr ""
"partitions:\n"
"  $name: \"Hard Disk Partitions\"\n"
"  $type: \"edit-group\"\n"
"  $minItems: 1\n"
"  $maxItems: 4\n"
"  $itemName: \"Partition ${name}\"\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"New partition\"\n"
"    mountpoint:\n"
"      $default: \"/var\"\n"
"    size:\n"
"      $type: \"number\"\n"
"      $name: \"Size in GB\"\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"Boot\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/boot\"\n"
"    - name: \"Root\"\n"
"      mountpoint: \"/\"\n"
"      size: 5000\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:157
msgid "Click btn:[Add] to fill the form with the default values."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Add] ເພື່ອຕື່ມແບບຟອມດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:158
msgid ""
"The formula is called [path]``hd-partitions`` and will appear as "
"[guimenu]``Hd Partitions`` in the {webui}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "formula-custom-harddisk-partitions.png"
msgstr "formula-custom-harddisk-partitions.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:160
msgid ""
"To remove the definition of a partition click the minus symbol in the title "
"line of an inner group."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລຶບການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ partition ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບໃນແຖວຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງກຸ່ມພາຍໃນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:161
msgid "When you are finished, click btn:[Save Formula]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Save Formula]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Nested edit-group"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: edit-group ແບບຊ້ອນກັນ (Nested)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"users:\n"
"  $name: \"Users\"\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 2\n"
"  $maxItems: 5\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"username\"\n"
"    password:\n"
"      $type: password\n"
"    groups:\n"
"      $type: edit-group\n"
"      $minItems: 1\n"
"      $prototype:\n"
"        group_name:\n"
"          $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"root\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
"        - group_name: \"admins\"\n"
"    - name: \"admin\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
msgstr ""
"users:\n"
"  $name: \"Users\"\n"
"  $type: edit-group\n"
"  $minItems: 2\n"
"  $maxItems: 5\n"
"  $prototype:\n"
"    name:\n"
"      $default: \"username\"\n"
"    password:\n"
"      $type: password\n"
"    groups:\n"
"      $type: edit-group\n"
"      $minItems: 1\n"
"      $prototype:\n"
"        group_name:\n"
"          $type: text\n"
"  $default:\n"
"    - name: \"root\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"
"        - group_name: \"admins\"\n"
"    - name: \"admin\"\n"
"      groups:\n"
"        - group_name: \"users\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "Writing Salt Formulas"
msgstr "ການຂຽນ Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:165
msgid ""
"Salt formulas are pre-written Salt states.  You can use Jinja to configure "
"formulas with pillar data."
msgstr "Salt formulas ແມ່ນ Salt states ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Jinja ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ formulas ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:166
msgid "Basic Jinja syntax is:"
msgstr "ໄວຍາກອນ Jinja ພື້ນຖານແມ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "pillar.some.value\n"
msgstr "pillar.some.value\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:168
msgid "When you are sure a pillar exists, use this syntax:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານແນ່ໃຈວ່າ pillar ນັ້ນມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt['pillar.get']('some:value', 'default value')\n"
msgstr "salt['pillar.get']('some:value', 'default value')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:170
msgid ""
"You can also replace the `pillar` value with `grains`.  For example, "
"``grains.some.value``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:171
msgid ""
"Using data this way makes the formula configurable.  In this example, a "
"specified package is installed in the ``package_name`` pillar:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:172
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"install_a_package:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ pillar.package_name }}\n"
msgstr ""
"install_a_package:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ pillar.package_name }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:173
msgid ""
"You can also use more complex constructs such as `if/else` and `for-loops` "
"to provide greater functionality:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ `if/else` ແລະ `for-loops` ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if pillar.installSomething %}\n"
"something:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"anotherPackage:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% if pillar.installSomething %}\n"
"something:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"anotherPackage:\n"
"  pkg.installed\n"
"{% endif %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:175
msgid "Another example:"
msgstr "ອີກຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% for service in pillar.services %}\n"
"start_{{ service }}:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: {{ service }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% for service in pillar.services %}\n"
"start_{{ service }}:\n"
"  service.running:\n"
"    - name: {{ service }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:177
msgid ""
"Jinja also provides other helpful functions.  For example, you can iterate "
"over a dictionary:"
msgstr "Jinja ຍັງມີຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດອື່ນໆອີກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ການວົນຊ້ຳ (iterate) ໃນ dictionary ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% for key, value in some_dictionary.items() %}\n"
"do_something_with_{{ key }}: {{ value }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% for key, value in some_dictionary.items() %}\n"
"do_something_with_{{ key }}: {{ value }}\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:179
msgid ""
"You can have Salt manage your files (for example, configuration files for a "
"program), and change them with pillar data."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ Salt ຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບໂປຣແກຣມ), ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງພວກມັນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:180
msgid ""
"In this example, Salt copies the file "
"[path]``salt-file_roots/my_state/files/my_program.conf`` on the server to "
"[path]``/etc/my_program/my_program.conf`` on the client and template it with "
"Jinja:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:181
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/my_program/my_program.conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://my_state/files/my_program.conf\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/my_program/my_program.conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - source: salt://my_state/files/my_program.conf\n"
"    - template: jinja\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:182
msgid ""
"This example allows you to use Jinja in the file, like the previous example "
"for states:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Jinja ໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ ຄືກັນກັບຕົວຢ່າງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ສຳລັບ states:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "some_config_option = {{ pillar.config_option_a }}\n"
msgstr "some_config_option = {{ pillar.config_option_a }}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate Data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນແຍກ (Separate Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:185
msgid ""
"Separating data from a state can increase flexibility and make it easier to "
"re-use.  You can do this by writing values into a separate file named "
"[path]``map.jinja``.  This file must be within the same directory as the "
"state files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:186
msgid ""
"This example sets `data` to a dictionary with different values, depending on "
"which system the state runs on.  It will also merge data with the pillar "
"using the `some.pillar.data` value so you can access "
"`some.pillar.data.value` by using ``data.value``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:187
msgid ""
"You can choose to override defined values from pillars.  For example, by "
"overriding `some.pillar.data.package` in this example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະຂຽນທັບ (override) ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດຈາກ pillars ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໂດຍການຂຽນທັບ `some.pillar.data.package` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% set data = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'packageA',\n"
"        'service': 'serviceA'\n"
"    },\n"
"    'RedHat': {\n"
"        'package': 'package_a',\n"
"        'service': 'service_a'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('some:pillar:data')) %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% set data = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'packageA',\n"
"        'service': 'serviceA'\n"
"    },\n"
"    'RedHat': {\n"
"        'package': 'package_a',\n"
"        'service': 'service_a'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('some:pillar:data')) %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:189
msgid ""
"When you have created a map file, you can maintain compatibility with "
"multiple system types while accessing deep pillar data in a simpler way."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງໄຟລ໌ map ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດຮັກສາຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຫຼາຍປະເພດລະບົບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ຢູ່ເລິກໆໄດ້ໃນແບບທີ່ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:190
msgid "Now you can import and use `data` in any file.  For example:"
msgstr "ດຽວນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າ (import) ແລະ ໃຊ້ `data` ໃນໄຟລ໌ໃດກໍໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "{% from \"some_folder/map.jinja\" import data with context %}\n"
msgstr "{% from \"some_folder/map.jinja\" import data with context %}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:192
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"install_package_a:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ data.package }}\n"
msgstr ""
"install_package_a:\n"
"  pkg.installed:\n"
"    - name: {{ data.package }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:193
msgid ""
"You can define multiple variables by copying the `{% set ...%}` statement "
"with different values and then merge it with other pillars.  For example:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຫຼາຍຕົວປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການສຳເນົາຄຳສັ່ງ `{% set ...%}` ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລ້ວລວມມັນເຂົ້າກັບ pillars ອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:194
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% set server = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-server-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:server')) %}\n"
"{% set client = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-client-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:client')) %}\n"
msgstr ""
"{% set server = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-server-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:server')) %}\n"
"{% set client = salt['grains.filter_by']({\n"
"    'Suse': {\n"
"        'package': 'my-client-pkg'\n"
"    }\n"
"}, merge=salt['pillar.get']('myFormula:client')) %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:195
msgid "To import multiple variables, separate them with a comma.  For example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າຫຼາຍຕົວປ່ຽນ, ໃຫ້ແຍກພວກມັນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:196
#, no-wrap
msgid "{% from \"map.jinja\" import server, client with context %}\n"
msgstr "{% from \"map.jinja\" import server, client with context %}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:197
msgid ""
"For more information about conventions to use when writing formulas, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/development/conventions/formulas.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (conventions) ທີ່ຄວນໃຊ້ໃນການຂຽນ formulas, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/development/conventions/formulas.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:198
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generated Pillar Data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (Generated Pillar Data)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:199
msgid ""
"Pillar data is generated by {productname} when events occur like generating "
"the highstate.  You can use an external pillar script to generate pillar "
"data for packages and group IDs, and include all pillar data for a system:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ {productname} ເມື່ອມີເຫດການຕ່າງໆເກີດຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ການສ້າງ highstate. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ pillar ພາຍນອກເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດ ແລະ group ID, ແລະ ລວມເອົາຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທັງໝົດສຳລັບລະບົບນັ້ນໆ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/modules/pillar/suma_minion.py\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:201
msgid "The process is executed like this:"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການແບບນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:202
msgid ""
"The `suma_minion.py` script starts and finds all formulas for a system by "
"checking the `group_formulas.json` and `server_formulas.json` files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:203
msgid ""
"The script loads the values for each formula (groups and from the system) "
"and merges them with the highstate."
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຈະໂຫຼດຄ່າສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ formula (ທັງຈາກກຸ່ມ ແລະ ຈາກລະບົບ) ແລ້ວລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບ highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:204
msgid ""
"By default, if no values are found, a group overrides a system if `$scope: "
"group`."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຄ່າໃດໆ, ກຸ່ມຈະຂຽນທັບລະບົບ ຖ້າຫາກກຳນົດ `$scope: group`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:205
msgid ""
"The script also includes a list of formulas applied to the system in a "
"pillar named ``formulas``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:206
msgid ""
"This structure makes it possible to include states.  In this example, the "
"top file is specifically generated by the `mgr_master_tops.py` script.  The "
"top file includes a state called ``formulas`` for each system.  This "
"includes the `formulas.sls` file located in "
"[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states`` or "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/``.  The content looks similar to "
"this:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "include: {{ pillar[\"formulas\"] }}\n"
msgstr "include: {{ pillar[\"formulas\"] }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:208
msgid ""
"This pillar includes all formulas that are specified in the pillar data "
"generated from the external pillar script."
msgstr "Pillar ນີ້ລວມເອົາ formulas ທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກສະຄຣິບ pillar ພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:209
msgid ""
"Formulas should be created directly after {productname} is installed.  If "
"you encounter any problems with formulas check these things first:"
msgstr "Formulas ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ສຳເລັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບກັບບັນຫາໃດໆກ່ຽວກັບ formulas ໃຫ້ກວດສອບສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກ່ອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:210
msgid "The external pillar script (``suma_minion.py``) must include formula data."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:211
msgid ""
"Data is saved to [path]``/srv/susemanager/formula_data`` and the "
"[path]``pillar`` and [path]``group_pillar`` sub-directories."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:212
msgid "These directories should be automatically generated by the server."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:213
msgid "Formulas must be included for every client listed in the top file."
msgstr "Formulas ຕ້ອງຖືກລວມເຂົ້າສຳລັບທຸກໆ client ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ top file."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc:214
msgid ""
"Currently this process is initiated by the [path]``mgr_master_tops.py`` "
"script which includes the `formulas.sls` file located in "
"[path]``/usr/share/susemanager/formulas/states/`` or "
"[path]``/usr/share/salt-formulas/states/``.  This directory must be a salt "
"file root.  File roots are configured on the salt-master ({productname}) "
"located at [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/susemanager.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Formulas"
msgstr "Salt Formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Formulas are collections of Salt States that contain generic parameter "
"fields.  Formulas allow for reliable reproduction of a specific "
"configuration.  Some formulas are supplied by {suse}, or you can install "
"formulas from RPM packages or an external git repository."
msgstr "Formulas ແມ່ນການລວບລວມຂອງ Salt States ທີ່ມີຟີວພາຣາມິເຕີທົ່ວໄປ. Formulas ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ການສ້າງການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະຄືນໃໝ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ບາງ formulas ແມ່ນຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {suse}, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ formulas ຈາກ RPM packages ຫຼື git repository ພາຍນອກກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Formulas work best for large, non-trivial, configurations.  For smaller "
"tasks, use a state rather than a formula.  Formulas and states both act as a "
"kind of configuration documentation.  When you have written and stored the "
"configuration, they provide a snapshot of your infrastructure."
msgstr "Formulas ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ຊັບຊ້ອນ. ສຳລັບວຽກຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ state ແທນ formula. ທັງ formulas ແລະ states ຕ່າງກໍເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບເອກະສານການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ເມື່ອທ່ານຂຽນ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບ ການກຳນົດຄ່າແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນພາບລວມ (snapshot) ຂອງໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:4
msgid "Formula data can be managed using the XMLRPC API."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Formula ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ XMLRPC API."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to apply {productname} formulas.  The "
"most commonly used formulas are documented in this section."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} {webui} ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ {productname} formulas ໄດ້. formulas ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use pre-written formulas as a starting point for your "
"own custom formulas.  Pre-written formulas are available from "
"https://github.com/saltstack-formulas."
msgstr "ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ formulas ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການສ້າງ formulas ຂອງທ່ານເອງ. formulas ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ແລ້ວສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://github.com/saltstack-formulas."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-formulas-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information on custom formulas, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ formulas ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formulas-custom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gitfs Fileserver Backend"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຫຼັງ (Backend) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ເຊີເວີ gitfs"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, [package]``pygit2`` is the supported Python interface to "
"git.  When [package]``pygit2`` is installed the ``gitfs`` fileserver backend "
"is available and it is a supported feature."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Configuration options are set in the [path]``/etc/salt/master`` file, or in "
"a separate configuration file in the [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/`` "
"directory.  The basic settings are:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "fileserver_backend"
msgstr "fileserver_backend"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"List of fileserver backends that the Salt master checks for files in the "
"order they are defined.  Options:"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂອງ fileserver backends ທີ່ Salt master ຈະກວດສອບຫາໄຟລ໌ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:6
msgid "[literal]``roots``: Files local on the Salt master ({productname} Server)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"[literal]``roots`` is required to keep the product running.  You can only "
"enable [literal]``gitfs`` optionally.  Additionally, {suse} strongly "
"recommends to prefer [literal]``roots`` (local files) over "
"[literal]``gitfs``.  The standard backend."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:8
msgid "[literal]``gitfs``: Files stored in one or more git repositories."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:9
msgid "The repositories are defined with [literal]``gitfs_remotes``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fileserver_backend:\n"
"  - roots\n"
"  - git\n"
msgstr ""
"fileserver_backend:\n"
"  - roots\n"
"  - git\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "gitfs_remotes"
msgstr "gitfs_remotes"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:13
msgid ""
"List of git repositories.  ``git://``, ``https://``, ``file://``, or "
"``ssh://`` URLs can be configured.  For SSH remotes, a [command]``scp``-like "
"syntax is also supported; for example: "
"[literal]``gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git``.  Then you can "
"also specify options for credentials, file locations, or branches such as "
"[literal]``pubkey``, [literal]``privkey``, "
"[literal]``root``,[literal]``base``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gitfs_remotes:\n"
"  - https://example.com/myformulas/formula.git\n"
"  - gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"    - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"    - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
"    - root: srv/salt\n"
"    - base: master\n"
msgstr ""
"gitfs_remotes:\n"
"  - https://example.com/myformulas/formula.git\n"
"  - gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"    - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"    - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
"    - root: srv/salt\n"
"    - base: master\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "ext_pillar"
msgstr "ext_pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"List of external pillar interfaces.  Salt can also serve pillar data from "
"one or more git repositories.  For syntax and options, also see the "
"[literal]``gitfs_remotes`` setting."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - git:\n"
"    - master gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"      - root: srv/pillar\n"
"      - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"      - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"
msgstr ""
"ext_pillar:\n"
"  - git:\n"
"    - master gitlab@gitlab.example.com:universe/setup.git:\n"
"      - root: srv/pillar\n"
"      - pubkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab.pub\n"
"      - privkey: /var/lib/salt/.ssh/id_rsa_gitlab\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:21
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/gitfs.html"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/tutorials/gitfs.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gitfs.adoc:22
msgid "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html"
msgstr "https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/master.html"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Encrypted Pillars"
msgstr "GPG Encrypted Pillars"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{salt} has support to transparently decrypt GPG-encrypted Pillar data "
"built-in.  The decryption happens on the {salt} Master."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate GPG keyring for {salt} Master"
msgstr "ສ້າງ GPG keyring ສຳລັບ {salt} Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The GPG keyring can be specified in [path]``/etc/salt/master`` or in its own "
"file under [path]``/etc/salt/master.d/``, for example "
"[path]``/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:5
msgid "Always create a separate keyring for the {salt} Master."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສ້າງ keyring ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບ {salt} Master ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating key pair"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄູ່ຄີ (key pair)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:7
msgid "On the {salt} Master create GPG home directory and restrict its permissions:"
msgstr "ໃນ {salt} Master ໃຫ້ສ້າງ GPG home directory ແລະ ຈຳກັດສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
"chmod 700 /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
"chmod 700 /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:9
msgid "Generate a key pair interactively."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄູ່ຄີແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ (interactively)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:10
msgid "The password must be empty."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຕ້ອງຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (empty)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "gpg --gen-key --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr "gpg --gen-key --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:12
msgid ""
"{salt} does not run with root permissions on SUSE Linux Enterprise and "
"openSUSE distributions."
msgstr "{salt} ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍສິດ root ໃນ SUSE Linux Enterprise ແລະ openSUSE."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "chown -R salt:salt /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"
msgstr "chown -R salt:salt /etc/salt/gpgkeys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:14
msgid "Configure {salt} Master to use the new GPG home directory"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ {salt} Master ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ GPG home directory ໃໝ່"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 'gpg_keydir: /etc/salt/gpgkeys' >/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf\n"
"systemctl reload-or-restart salt-master\n"
msgstr ""
"echo 'gpg_keydir: /etc/salt/gpgkeys' >/etc/salt/master.d/gpg-pillar.conf\n"
"systemctl reload-or-restart salt-master\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use GPG for encrypting Pillar secrets"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ GPG ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນລັບໃນ Pillar"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Salt GPG renderer decrypts GPG encrypted contents that are ASCI-armored.  To "
"use the GPG renderer in a Pillar YAML file, change"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "#!yaml\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:19
msgid "to"
msgstr "ເປັນ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:20
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "#!yaml|gpg\n"
msgstr "#!yaml|gpg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Encrypting pillar secrets can be done anywhere as long as the GPG and the "
"public key generated in <<proc-key-pair-generation>> are available."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຄວາມລັບຂອງ pillar ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສກໍໄດ້ ຕາບໃດທີ່ GPG ແລະ public key ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ <<proc-key-pair-generation>> ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:22
msgid "In this example, \"SUMA Salt Master\" is the GPG key’s UID created earlier."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 't0ps3cr3t' | gpg --armor --batch --encrypt --recipient \"SUMA Salt "
"Master\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:24
msgid ""
"When the GPG encrytped contents are created and available as ASCII-armored "
"output, this output can be used as a multi-line string in a pillar YAML "
"file:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເນື້ອໃນທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍ GPG ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ ASCII-armored, ຜົນລັດພໍນີ້ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ເປັນ multi-line string ໃນໄຟລ໌ pillar YAML ໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"secret:\n"
"  my-secret: |\n"
"    -----BEGIN PGP MESSAGE-----\n"
msgstr ""
"secret:\n"
"  my-secret: |\n"
"    -----BEGIN PGP MESSAGE-----\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    hQEMA3OrmRaWrqgqAQf/ej8xV+nO3HVbQRCeJgCmt5ZjnogT++HHeFzXymfr1SgT\n"
"    XySyAqpIZB2N6MjZXtupO2sCmG6fzqtmnW+vRsZhQG8PAqzRtAekFuVbXzgkigBk\n"
"    338yOdyltVBtMONnkHFQ+7EP1tfJnWLCVrJ1I42vGFLZf2AD1xhbjewCcoaK82J4\n"
"    f8u9U/dxgV0N6na28WG5m6YU5Reu1Ca37PXHuqA/0XZl65DY63xaMPMDHZEi1wkU\n"
"    GXU7OsiL1dO0/sST1Awo5i99kVt/kA6DCGDuxTNpLrauNLOKUbtwcxvavtNZGwdQ\n"
"    yI9zWVx8qerWE0aO3M7zVDJftv77faV2ENiqzaadvtJHAZynW4GW7rSuP1RXFzlB\n"
"    DOAmzdRuIJwiLC9R2BKu3x+avReQb6xoz7eF7WthC0H0dz4mYakwPlVZ5yqYa/+G\n"
"    83i951rqAGI=\n"
"    =g+ji\n"
"    -----END PGP MESSAGE-----\n"
msgstr ""
"    hQEMA3OrmRaWrqgqAQf/ej8xV+nO3HVbQRCeJgCmt5ZjnogT++HHeFzXymfr1SgT\n"
"    XySyAqpIZB2N6MjZXtupO2sCmG6fzqtmnW+vRsZhQG8PAqzRtAekFuVbXzgkigBk\n"
"    338yOdyltVBtMONnkHFQ+7EP1tfJnWLCVrJ1I42vGFLZf2AD1xhbjewCcoaK82J4\n"
"    f8u9U/dxgV0N6na28WG5m6YU5Reu1Ca37PXHuqA/0XZl65DY63xaMPMDHZEi1wkU\n"
"    GXU7OsiL1dO0/sST1Awo5i99kVt/kA6DCGDuxTNpLrauNLOKUbtwcxvavtNZGwdQ\n"
"    yI9zWVx8qerWE0aO3M7zVDJftv77faV2ENiqzaadvtJHAZynW4GW7rSuP1RXFzlB\n"
"    DOAmzdRuIJwiLC9R2BKu3x+avReQb6xoz7eF7WthC0H0dz4mYakwPlVZ5yqYa/+G\n"
"    83i951rqAGI=\n"
"    =g+ji\n"
"    -----END PGP MESSAGE-----\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:28
msgid ""
"When the pillar is assigned to a system with [path]``top.sls``, the GPG "
"encrypted pillar data is available in a decrypted format."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The client's in-memory cache is only updated on startup or when running "
"execution module functions that trigger a cache refresh such as "
"[literal]``saltutil.refresh_pillar``, [litaral]``pillar.items``, or "
"[literal]``state.apply``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"suma-sles15sp1.tf.local:\n"
"    ----------\n"
"    my-secret:\n"
"        t0p s3cr3t!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export the GPG key"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ GPG key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:32
msgid "To export the GPG key, use the command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກ GPG key, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gpg --export 'SUMA Salt Master' --homedir /etc/salt/gpgkeys --output "
"suma-salt-master.gpg\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:34
msgid "Here 'SUMA Salt Master' is the name used during key generation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-gpg-encrypted-pillars.adoc:35
msgid "The [literal]```suma-salt-master.gpg``` public key can be freely shared."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc:3
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on managing large scale deployments, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Guide Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງ Salt Guide"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is a remote execution engine, configuration management and "
"orchestration system used by {productname} to manage clients."
msgstr "Salt ແມ່ນ remote execution engine, ລະບົບການຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າ (configuration management) ແລະ ລະບົບການຈັດການຂະບວນການ (orchestration) ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ {productname} ເພື່ອຈັດການ clients."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, the Salt master runs on the {productname} Server, allowing "
"you to register and manage Salt clients."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, Salt master ຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານ ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ຈັດການ Salt clients ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:4
msgid "This book is designed to be a primer for using Salt with {productname}."
msgstr "ປຶ້ມຫົວນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເປັນຄູ່ມືເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳລັບການໃຊ້ Salt ຮ່ວມກັບ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt, see the Salt documentation at "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງ Salt ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/contents.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-overview.adoc:6
msgid "The current version of Salt in {productname} is {saltversion}."
msgstr "ເວີຊັນປະຈຸບັນຂອງ Salt ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນ {saltversion}."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Rate Limiting"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ Salt (Salt Rate Limiting)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt is able to run commands in parallel on a large number of clients.  This "
"can potentially create large amounts of load on your infrastructure.  You "
"can use these rate-limiting parameters to control the load in your "
"environment."
msgstr "Salt ສາມາດປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງແບບຂະໜານ (parallel) ໃນ clients ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະສ້າງ load ມະຫາສານໃຫ້ກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ ພາຣາມິເຕີການຈຳກັດອັດຕາ (rate-limiting) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ load ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:3
msgid ""
"These parameters are all configured in the [filename]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` "
"configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Salt commands that are executed from the command line are not subject to "
"these parameters."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ທີ່ຖືກປະຕິບັດຜ່ານ command line ຈະບໍ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການຄວບຄຸມຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Batching"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກແບບກຸ່ມ (Batching)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:6
msgid ""
"There are two parameters that control how actions are sent to clients, one "
"for the batch size, and one for the delay."
msgstr "ມີສອງພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງໄປຫາ clients, ໜຶ່ງແມ່ນສຳລັບຂະໜາດ batch (batch size), ແລະ ອີກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນສຳລັບການໜ່ວງເວລາ (delay)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When the {productname} Server sends a batch of actions to the target "
"clients, it will send it to the number of clients determined in the batch "
"size parameter.  After the specified delay period, commands will be sent to "
"the next batch of clients.  The number of clients in each subsequent batch "
"is equal to the number of clients that have completed in the previous batch."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ {productname} Server ສົ່ງຊຸດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ (batch) ໄປຫາ client ເປົ້າໝາຍ, ມັນຈະສົ່ງໄປຫາຈຳນວນ client ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນພາຣາມິເຕີ batch size. ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດໄລຍະເວລາໜ່ວງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້, ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ batch ຖັດໄປຂອງ clients. ຈຳນວນ client ໃນແຕ່ລະ batch ຕໍ່ມາຈະເທົ່າກັບຈຳນວນ client ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວໃນ batch ກ່ອນໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Choosing a lower batch size will reduce system load and parallelism, but "
"might reduce overall performance for processing actions."
msgstr "ການເລືອກ batch size ທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດ system load ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານ, ແຕ່ອາດຈະຫຼຸດປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍລວມໃນການປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ."

#.  Defaulte is 200 according to salt-large-scale-tuning.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The batch size parameter sets the maximum number of clients that can execute "
"a single action at the same time.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_batch_size`` parameter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:10
msgid "Defaults to 200."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 200."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Increasing the delay increases the chance that multiple clients will have "
"completed before the next action is issued (more clients are grouped "
"together in subsequent batches), resulting in fewer overall commands, and "
"reducing load."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມໄລຍະເວລາໜ່ວງ (delay) ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມໂອກາດທີ່ client ຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງຈະເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຄຳສັ່ງຖັດໄປຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ (ເຮັດໃຫ້ client ຖືກລວມກຸ່ມເຂົ້າກັນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນ batch ຕໍ່ໆໄປ), ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງໂດຍລວມໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດ load ຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The batch delay parameter sets the amount of time, in seconds, to wait after "
"a command from the previous batch is processed before beginning to process "
"the command on the next client.  Adjust the "
"[systemitem]``java.salt_batch_delay`` parameter.  Defaults to 1.0 seconds."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling the Salt Mine"
msgstr "ການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Salt Mine"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In older versions, {productname} used a tool called Salt mine to check "
"client availability.  The Salt mine would cause clients to contact the "
"server every hour, which created significant load.  With the introduction of "
"a more efficient mechanism in {productname}{nbsp}3.2, the Salt mine is no "
"longer required.  Instead, the {productname} Server uses Taskomatic to ping "
"only the clients that appear to have been offline for twelve hours or more, "
"with all clients being contacted at least once in every twenty four hour "
"period by default.  You can adjust this by changing the "
"[systemitem]``web.system_checkin_threshold`` parameter in "
"[path]``rhn.conf``.  The value is expressed in days, and the default value "
"is [literal]``1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Newly registered Salt clients will have the Salt mine disabled by default.  "
"If the Salt mine is running on your system, you can reduce load by disabling "
"it.  This is especially effective if you have a large number of clients."
msgstr "Salt clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Salt mine ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຫາກ Salt mine ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼຸດ load ໄດ້ໂດຍການປິດການໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນຜົນໄດ້ດີໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກທ່ານມີ client ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:16
msgid "Disable the Salt mine by running this command on the server:"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ Salt mine ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນ server:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-rate-limiting.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This will restart the clients and generate some Salt events to be processed "
"by the server.  If you have a large number of clients, handling these events "
"could create excessive load.  To avoid this, you can execute the command in "
"batch mode with this command:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດການຣີສະຕາດ clients ແລະ ສ້າງ Salt events ບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ server ປະມວນຜົນ. ຫາກທ່ານມີ client ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການຈັດການກັບເຫດການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດສ້າງ load ມະຫາສານ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫານີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງໃນ batch mode ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-scaling-minions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scaling Minions (Large Scale Deployments)"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ Minions (ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່)"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH"
msgstr "Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH allows Salt commands and states to be issued directly over SSH.  "
"SSH connections are created on demand, when the server executes an action on "
"a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ ແລະ states ຂອງ Salt ຜ່ານ SSH ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍ, ເມື່ອ server ປະຕິບັດຄຳສັ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information about Salt SSH, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt SSH, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Connection Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH (SSH Connection Methods)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In {productname} there are two SSH connection methods, `ssh-push` and "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`.  In both methods the server initiates an SSH connection "
"to the client to execute a Salt call."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} ມີສອງວິທີໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຄື: `ssh-push` ແລະ `ssh-push-tunnel`. ໃນທັງສອງວິທີ, server ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາ client ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push` method, the package manager works as normal, and the HTTP "
"or HTTPS connection is directly created."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push`, ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດ (package manager) ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕາມປົກກະຕິ, ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the `ssh-push-tunnel` method, the server creates an HTTP or HTTPS "
"connection through an SSH tunnel.  The HTTP connection initiated by the "
"package manager is redirected through the tunnel using `/etc/hosts` "
"aliasing.  Use this method for in-place firewall environments that block "
"HTTP or HTTPS connections between server and client."
msgstr "ໃນວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel`, server ຈະສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ຜ່ານ SSH tunnel. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍ package manager ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານ tunnel ໂດຍການໃຊ້ `/etc/hosts` aliasing. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີ firewall ປິດກັ້ນ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS ລະຫວ່າງ server ແລະ client."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt SSH Integration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Salt SSH (Salt SSH Integration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:9
msgid "As with all Salt calls, {productname} invokes `salt-ssh` via the `salt-api`."
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt ທັງໝົດ, {productname} ຈະຮຽກໃຊ້ `salt-ssh` ຜ່ານ `salt-api`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Salt SSH relies on a roster to obtain details such as hostname, ports, and "
"the SSH parameters of a client.  {productname} keeps these details in the "
"database and makes them available to Salt SSH by using the "
"[literal]``uyuni`` roster module, or by generating a temporary roster file "
"on bootstrapping new clients with the {webui}.  The location of the "
"temporary roster file is supplied to Salt SSH using the "
"[option]``roster-file`` option.  For the registered clients "
"[option]``roster`` set to `uyuni` is used instead to get the roster from the "
"database with `uyuni` salt roster module."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"It is not recommended to run [command]``salt-ssh`` as [literal]``root`` "
"user. This can cause permission issues the next time {productname} tries to "
"use Salt SSH.  Use [command]``mgr-salt-ssh``, which changes the effective "
"user to [literal]``salt`` and avoids file permission issues.  If you want to "
"use [command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` with a user other than [literal]``root``, the "
"user should have the permission to change effective user to "
"[literal]``salt``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:12
msgid ""
"[command]``mgr-salt-ssh`` uses [option]``roster`` set to [literal]``uyuni`` "
"by default, if neither [option]``roster`` nor [option]``roster-file`` "
"specified in the command line.  It helps to call Salt commands to the "
"registered Salt SSH clients with no roster file generation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດ (Authentication)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Salt SSH supports both password and key authentication.  {productname} uses "
"both methods:"
msgstr "Salt SSH ຮອງຮັບທັງການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ (password) ແລະ ດ້ວຍຄີ (key). {productname} ຈະໃຊ້ທັງສອງວິທີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Password authentication is used only when bootstrapping.  During the "
"bootstrap step the key of the server is not authorized on the client and "
"therefore a password must be used for a connection to be made.  The password "
"is used transiently in a temporary roster file used for bootstrapping and "
"the roster file is removed on finishing processing the event.  This password "
"is not stored."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap, ຄີຂອງ server ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນ client, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ເພື່ອສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ລະຫັດຜ່ານຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ bootstrap ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ roster ນັ້ນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເມື່ອຂະບວນການສຳເລັດ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:16
msgid ""
"All other common Salt calls use key authentication.  During the bootstrap "
"step the SSH key of the server is authorized on the client and added to the "
"client [path]``/.ssh/authorized_keys`` file.  Subsequent calls no longer "
"require a password."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Account"
msgstr "ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ (User Account)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The user for Salt SSH calls made by {productname} is taken from the "
"`ssh_push_sudo_user` setting.  By default, the user is root."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ໂດຍ {productname} ແມ່ນນຳມາຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `ssh_push_sudo_user`. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ root."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If bootstrapping with default settings fail, check whether the client allows "
"root login with ssh."
msgstr "ຫາກການ bootstrapping ດ້ວຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ client ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ root login ຜ່ານ ssh ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If the value of `ssh_push_sudo_user` is not root, then the `--sudo` options "
"of `salt-ssh` are used.  For this user you must configure the `NOPASSWD` "
"option in the [path]``sudoers`` file.  At least, set the python binary with "
"the version number; for example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"
msgstr "<USER> ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:/usr/bin/python3.6\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Redirection"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງ HTTP ໃໝ່ (HTTP Redirection)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The `ssh-push-tunnel` method requires traffic to be redirected through an "
"SSH tunnel.  This allows traffic to bypass firewalls blocking a direct "
"connection between the client and the server."
msgstr "ວິທີ `ssh-push-tunnel` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ traffic ຖືກປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜ່ານ SSH tunnel. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ traffic ສາມາດຜ່ານ firewall ທີ່ປິດກັ້ນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງລະຫວ່າງ client ແລະ server ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:24
msgid "This is achieved by using port 1233 in the repository URL:"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ port 1233 ໃນ repository URL:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://suma-server:1233/repourl...\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can alias the suma-server hostname to [literal]``localhost`` in "
"[path]``/etc/hosts``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "127.0.0.1       localhost    suma-server\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The server creates a reverse SSH tunnel that connects `localhost:1233` on "
"the client to `suma-server:443`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh ... -R 1233:suma-server:443\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This means that the package manager will actually connect to "
"`localhost:1233`, which is then forwarded to `suma-server:443` by the SSH "
"tunnel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The package manager can contact the server only if the tunnel is open, which "
"occurs only when the server executes an action on the client."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີໄດ້ ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອອຸໂມງຖືກເປີດຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຊີເວີດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງຢູ່ເທິງໄຄລເອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Manual package manager operations that require server connectivity are not "
"possible in this case."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດງານຂອງ package manager ດ້ວຍຕົວເອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ server ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ (Call Sequence)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:34
msgid "Salt SSH calls run in this sequence:"
msgstr "ການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ຈະດຳເນີນຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Set `roster` parameter to `uyuni` for registered clients or prepare the Salt "
"roster on bootstrapping for the call"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີ `roster` ເປັນ `uyuni` ສຳລັບ clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ ຫຼື ກຽມ Salt roster ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrapping ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Create remote port forwarding option if the contact method is "
"`ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "ສ້າງຕົວເລືອກ remote port forwarding ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:37
msgid "Compute the `ProxyCommand` if the client is connected through a proxy"
msgstr "ຄຳນວນ `ProxyCommand` ຫາກ client ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:38
msgid "Create Roster content"
msgstr "ສ້າງເນື້ອໃນ Roster"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:39
msgid "Create a temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrapping new client)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:40
msgid "Execute a synchronous `salt-ssh` call using the API"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດການຮຽກໃຊ້ `salt-ssh` ແບບ synchronous ໂດຍໃຊ້ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:41
msgid "Remove the temporary roster file (only in case of bootstrapping new client)"
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ roster ຊົ່ວຄາວອອກ (ສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີ bootstrapping new client)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:42
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:80
msgid "The roster content contains:"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງ roster ປະກອບມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:43
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:81
msgid "`hostname`"
msgstr "`hostname`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:44
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:82
msgid "`user`"
msgstr "`user`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:45
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:84
msgid "`port`"
msgstr "`port`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:46
msgid "`remote_port_forwards`: The remote port forwarding SSH option"
msgstr "`remote_port_forwards`: ຕົວເລືອກ remote port forwarding ຂອງ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:47
msgid "`ssh_options`: Other ssh options:"
msgstr "`ssh_options`: ຕົວເລືອກ ssh ອື່ນໆ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:48
msgid "`ProxyCommand`: If the client connects through a proxy"
msgstr "`ProxyCommand`: ຫາກ client ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:49
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:88
msgid "`timeout`: defaults to 180 seconds"
msgstr "`timeout`: ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 180 ວິນາທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:50
msgid "`minion_opts`:"
msgstr "`minion_opts`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:51
msgid "`master`: Set to the minion ID if the contact method is `ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "`master`: ຕັ້ງເປັນ minion ID ຫາກວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແມ່ນ `ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:52
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight`: The path to the shell script executed on the client before "
"running any Salt command"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight`: ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ shell script ທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດໃນ client ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກຄຳສັ່ງ Salt ໃດໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:53
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:90
msgid ""
"`ssh_pre_flight_args`: The list of arguments to call the pre flight script "
"on the client"
msgstr "`ssh_pre_flight_args`: ລາຍການຂອງ arguments ເພື່ອຮຽກໃຊ້ pre flight script ໃນ client"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap Sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:55
msgid ""
"This section describes the sequence of events when clients are registered to "
"a Salt master.  While bootstrapping is a type of Salt SSH call, the sequence "
"differs slightly from regular SSH calls."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍລຳດັບຂອງເຫດການເມື່ອ clients ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເຂົ້າກັບ Salt master. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ bootstrapping ຈະເປັນການຮຽກໃຊ້ Salt SSH ປະເພດໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ລຳດັບຈະແຕກຕ່າງ ຈາກການຮຽກໃຊ້ SSH ປົກກະຕິເລັກນ້ອຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping uses Salt SSH for communication between the master and the "
"client.  This happens for both regular and SSH clients."
msgstr "Bootstrapping ຈະໃຊ້ Salt SSH ສຳລັບການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງ master ແລະ client. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງກັບ regular clients ແລະ SSH clients."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For a regular Salt client, generate and pre-authorize the Salt key of the "
"client."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ regular Salt client, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດ Salt key ຂອງ client ລ່ວງໜ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For an SSH client, if a proxy was selected, retrieve the SSH public key of "
"the proxy using the ``mgrutil.chain_ssh_cmd`` runner."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:59
msgid ""
"The runner copies the public key of the proxy to the server using SSH.  If "
"needed, it can chain multiple SSH commands to reach the proxy across "
"multiple hops."
msgstr "ຕົວລັນ (Runner) ສຳເນົາກຸນແຈສາທາລະນະ (public key) ຂອງພຣັອກຊີ (proxy) ໄປຫາເຊີເວີໂດຍໃຊ້ SSH. ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ມັນສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼາຍຄຳສັ່ງ SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງພຣັອກຊີຜ່ານຫຼາຍຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (hops)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:60
msgid "Generate pillar data for bootstrap."
msgstr "ສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສຳລັບ bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The pillar data is compiled and stored on the Salt master, and retrieved by "
"the client."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ຈະຖືກຮິບໂຮມ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Salt master, ແລະ ຖືກດຶງໄປໃຊ້ໂດຍ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:62
msgid "Generate the roster for bootstrapping into a temporary file on the client."
msgstr "ສ້າງ roster ສຳລັບ bootstrapping ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນ client."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:63
msgid "You can use the roster by passing it to the Salt API, with this command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ roster ໄດ້ໂດຍການສົ່ງມັນໄປຫາ Salt API ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-salt-ssh --roster-file=<temporary_bootstrap_roster> minion state.apply "
"certs,<bootstrap_state>`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For `bootstrap_state`, use `bootstrap` for regular clients or "
"`ssh_bootstrap` for SSH clients."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ `bootstrap_state`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `bootstrap` ສຳລັບ regular clients ຫຼື `ssh_bootstrap` ສຳລັບ SSH clients."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The way the client retrieves the pillar data depends on the contact method "
"you have chosen for your client:"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ client ດຶງເອົາຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກສຳລັບ client ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:67
msgid ""
"If you are using the `ssh-push-tunnel` contact method, ensure you have "
"completed the remote port forwarding option."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ `ssh-push-tunnel`, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ ຕົວເລືອກ remote port forwarding ສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If the client connects through a proxy, ensure you have completed the "
"`ProxyCommand` option."
msgstr "ຫາກ client ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ proxy, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ `ProxyCommand` ສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:69
msgid ""
"This depends on your proxy configuration, including how many proxies you "
"need to connect through."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ proxy ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມເຖິງຈຳນວນ proxy ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/specialized-guides/pages/salt/salt-ssh.adoc:70
msgid "Pillar data contains:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ Pillar ປະກອບມີ:"

